\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f0\fs36\lang9 Dragon Quest XI S NPC - Character Side Stories\b0\fs22\par
1. Sylvando\line 2. Jade\line 3. Rab\line 4. Erik\line 5. Hendrik\par
\b\fs24 1. Sylvando\b0\fs22\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cf1\f1 Dave\cell Poor Gondolia... 'Ard to believe this used to be the busiest, most bustlin' tradin' port in the 'ole wide world, ain't it?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell I mean, it ain't a surprise or nuffink, but when a lively place like this falls on 'ard times... Well, it's just sad, that's all.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Still, no use in mopin', I s'pose. Come on, Sylv. Let's 'ave a mooch around an' see wot the locals've got to say for 'emselves, shall we?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell 'Ang about\emdash we ain't even finished talkin' to the locals yet!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Come on, let's go an' 'ave a chinwag or two. The rest o' the world can wait a bit!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah! You are a turista, s\f0\'ec? Ahim\'e8... You come at the very bad time... Since Yggdrasil fall, everything is chaos!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is impossibile for the merchant like me to operate. No ships arrive. The people, they become desperate.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Some, they even turn to the life of crime. Santo cielo... Before long, this town is finished! Finito!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hercules\cell Per favore, you must be careful! The Beastly Boys, they see you are a traveller and they attack you immediately! Subito!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hercules\cell Already they steal the knapsack of a man who just arrive in town. I see him walk to the piazza after it happen. He look so, so sad...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: First the ships stop to arrive, then we are besieged by the bandits. Is an orribile life. Still, I must go on. Allora...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: P-Per favore, you must believe me! This is all that I have! Onestamente! P-Please, leave me alone!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hey! Mind your own business, will you? We're having a private conversation here. Clear off!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Are you still here!? You're starting to get on my nerves. Best make yourself scarce before I lose my temper!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: What's the matter with you? Can't you see the owner's...indisposed right now? Go and do your shopping somewhere else!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oi! Who told you you could watch!? Go on, get out of here!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The Beastly Boys, they try to steal from the shop of my brother.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I come here to help him, but now I am frightened, and I cannot move. Perdonami, dear brother! Forgive me! I am so much a coward!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A short time ago, I see a sad man walk along this road. He go toward the sea.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I no know what is his problem, but I have many problems of my own! Is too much for me to worry about strangers also...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This town's been full of fear and anxiety ever since Yggdrasil fell, and now it seems it has some home-grown hooligans to deal with on top of everything else.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I suppose it's to be expected, really. It's easy to stop being nice to others when you're stuck in a daily battle for survival.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is many scary things out in the world, no? Orribile monsters in the sea, Beastly Boys here in the town. But still, life, it go on. Allora...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell\par
Ah! I know you! You are the friend of the ragazzo with the good hairs, s\'ec? The one who save Placido? Santo cielo... The sea is so dangerous, but you come here anyway! You are an hero!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell And Gondolia needs an hero in this moment. The ships stop to come. The sailors, they have no work.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell Now they only drink from the morning to the night. Even my papa...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell I hate it! L'odio! I want the old Gondolia back!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell You visit Placido while you are here, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell His madre, she is so strict. Molto rigoroso! After Yggdrasil fall, she no let him leave the house!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell I understand she worry after what happen, but povero piccolo Placido! He must be so bored! Go and talk with him, per favore!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell\par
Per favore, Papa! Wake up! We go to look for the work in another town, s\'ec?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell\par
Ah! I know you! You are the friend of the ragazzo with the good hairs, s\'ec? The one who save Placido? Santo cielo... The sea is so dangerous, but you come here anyway! You are an hero!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
