\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell You visit Placido while you are here, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell His madre, she is so strict. Molto rigoroso! After Yggdrasil fall, she no let him leave the house!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell I understand she worry after what happen, but povero piccolo Placido! He must be so bored! Go and talk with him, per favore!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Zzz... Hic! Hnnngh... Never... Hic! Never I drink again! Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The world change completely when Yggdrasil fall. No more trade, no more work, no more food...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Many people, they start to drink... Me also... I am ashamed... My poor wife... My poor son... La mia povera famiglia...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell Is no trade after Yggdrasil fall. No trade mean no food, so we make the plan to give this food to the people of Gondolia!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell But we must be careful. The orribile Beastly Boys, they probably try to steal it. We must be molto vigile!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Scusa. The dock is closed. The sea is too dangerous. We no allow any ships to leave.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Santo cielo! Is you! Is really you! The Great Sylvando! Is such an honour! Madre mia, today is the greatest day in my life!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is true, many bad things happen recently. But sometimes a good thing happen, and you remember that life is worth to live! Aha ha!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I really drew the short straw getting left behind here to keep an eye on the place. You'd need a whole garrison to keep Gondolia in order these days!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Why, only just now I heard that some poor traveller's knapsack got pinched. The victim went off towards the square, apparently, but I haven't had a chance to go and talk to him yet...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This star, they call it the Lantern of Erdwin. Is bright, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And is big, also. Is maybe even bigger now, since Yggdrasil fall...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My husband cannot work, and my Benigno, he is still only a little ragazzo. S\'ec, I must do everything around here. Allora...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hello there! I'm a wandering wizard\f1\emdash\f0 though to be honest, I've been finding it rather hard to wander too far from the delicious cakes of Gondolia...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But now I can't get so much as a single biscuit! There's not enough food left for such frivolities, apparently.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The church will always be an haven, even in dark times such as these. If you wish to pray, prego...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This soldier, he is supposed to be here to protect us, s\'ec? But after Yggdrasil fall, he do nothing but drink from the morning to the night!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I understand he is sad\f1\emdash\f0 everyone is sad. But now is the time that Gondolia need men like him more than ever!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My shipmates, they go out to sea and they no come back...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I no worry! They are the greatest sailors in all of Gondolia! Before long they return as heroes, I know it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: After the World Tree fall, the sea become infested with huge monsters that no one ever see before. Is why no cargo ships come here no more.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But wait\f1\emdash\f0 somehow you come here by the ship, no? Then you are very lucky. Molto fortunato! Maybe is someone special who protect you...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Beastly Boys, they target my shop next, I think. Allora, let us do business before they arrive...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Scusa, these cakes, they are no for sale. I make them all for one man. Is a special order.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is strange, no? Molto curioso... Who would wish to eat so much cake when the world is in the time of crisis?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: To be honest, I worry about him. He look a lot like the knight from Heliodor who come here before, but much less healthy. S\'ec, he is white like the ghost...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My husband and our bambini, they are out on the boat when Yggdrasil fall. I no see them since...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I only wish I decide to go with them on that day. Is better than to be here all alone... (sniff)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Doge Rotondo\cell\par
Santo cielo! Is you! You and your friends help my little Placido, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Doge Rotondo\cell Ahh, but how things change here since that happy time... After Yggdrasil fall, is worse and worse every day...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Doge Rotondo\cell We lose many things, but you know the most important thing we lose? La pi\'f9 importante? Is hope. If only we have hope, then we can go on to live.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Doge Rotondo\cell But is no easy, finding hope in a world such as this. Infatti, is almost impossibile. And everyone here, they know this...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Doge Rotondo\cell We lose many things, but you know the most important thing we lose? La pi\'f9 importante? Is hope. If only we have hope, then we can go on to live.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Doge Rotondo\cell But is no easy, finding hope in a world such as this. Infatti, is almost impossibile. And everyone here, they know this...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell\par
Signore! Is you! I cannot believe you come back to here! Grazie mille!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell But signore, where is your friend? The one with the shiny hairs? He is no with you? You are alone?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell Per favore, signore. Is okay. You no need to lie to me. I understand the way of the world.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
