\pard\intbl\cell *: Mind you, I have been exhausted lately, what with all the extra patrols and whatnot. Can't really blame me if those little whippersnappers got the better of me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That's not to take away from your achievement, of course. You've clearly got something about you. Let me know if you fancy a military career\f1\emdash\f0 you'd go far, I reckon!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everyone complain about the Beastly Boys, but I know they have another side. Sometimes they come here to pray, and to apologise for the troubles they cause.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Those ragazzi, they too are nothing but the lost lambs, like all of us. You must pray for them too...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f2\u9670?\f3\u8810?\f0\lang9 01\f4\'8f\'89\'8a\'fa\'8f\'f3\'91\'d4\f3\u8811?\f4\'92\'a9\'82\'cc\'8f\'89\'89\'f1\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f0\lang9\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f2\u9670?\f3\u8810?\f0\lang9 01\f4\'8f\'89\'8a\'fa\'8f\'f3\'91\'d4\f3\u8811?\f4\'92\'a9\'82\'cc\f5\'a3\'b2\'bb\'d8\'c4\'bf\'d2\'d4\'bd\'b5\f4\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f0\lang9\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f2\u9670?\f3\u8810?\f0\lang9 01\f4\'8f\'89\'8a\'fa\'8f\'f3\'91\'d4\f3\u8811?\f4\'92\'a9\'82\'cc\f5\'a3\'b2\'bb\'d8\'c4\'bf\'d2\'d4\'bd\'b5\f4\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f0\lang9\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell\par
Signore! Is you! I cannot believe you come back to here! Grazie mille!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell But signore, where is your friend? The one with the shiny hairs? He is no with you? You are alone?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell Per favore, signore. Is okay. You no need to lie to me. I understand the way of the world.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell Never mind, signore! I am just happy to see you here! And you look so happy and healthy too! Bravo!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell But signore, you look like you have something to say. ...Che cosa!? Really!? You defeat the Beastly Boys!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell This mean that...I can go out and play again! Santo cielo, I no believe it! Is a miracle! Thank you, signore! Grazie mille!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell\par
Hm? You have something to say, signore? ...Che cosa!? Really!? You defeat the Beastly Boys!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell Then I can go out to play again, no? Santo cielo! Is a miracle! Grazie mille!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell I still can no believe you defeat the Beastly Boys, signore. You are an hero! Un eroe! Grazie mille to you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Tetsu\cell Y-You're back! And in one piece too! Goodness me... I don't suppose you managed to recover my knapsack as well, did you?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Tetsu\cell ...Oh well. I suppose it was a bit too much to ask. Thanks for trying, anyway.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Sylvando gives Tetsu his knapsack.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luciano\cell There is nothing like a beautiful song to make this dark world a little brighter! Prego, listen to this. Is good for the soul, I promise...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luciano\cell Fa la laaa! Gondoliaaa! \f2\u9834?\f0\par
People come from near, people come from faaar! \f2\u9834?\f0\par
People come to become the famous staaar! \f2\u9834?\f0  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Right, 'ow about we get out of 'ere and find some more folks in need of 'elp, eh? Reckon we could do worse than take a butcher's round that Laguna di Gondolia place for a start!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everyone feel so much better after you take care of that orribile gang. Is like\f1\emdash\f0 how you say\f1\emdash\f0 like a little hope return to Gondolia!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Mamma mia! Is them! Those ragazzi with you are the Beastly Boys themselves! Wait, you... You are all friends now?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sinceramente, I no believe it. Not only you take care of the punishment, also you take care of the rehabilitation! You are a saint, signore! Un santo!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is something different about the Beastly Boys now, no? They look...kind. Friendly. Molto gentile. Allora, it show that every one of us can change!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hercules\cell Is an happy surprise to learn there are still some people like you who cannot abandon a person in need.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hercules\cell After Yggdrasil fall, we need someone to bring us a little hope\f1\emdash\f0 un po' di speranza, s\'ec? Allora, signore, you are that someone. The hero of Gondolia!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Signore, you save the precious black armour from the Beastly Boys! Never I can thank you enough! Grazie milioni, miliardi, infinito!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This armour, they say is the former property of a world-famous knight. I hope it is\f1\emdash\f0 I spend an huge fortune on it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hope that when my shop reopen, customers come from all over Erdrea to outbid each other for it! You join them too, s\'ec? Aha ha ha!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is a tragedy. Una tragedia. All the time we know the Beastly Boys are desperate, but no one help them. They have no choice but to turn to the life of crime.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Grazie, signore. You show us a better way. If we help people like you help the Beastly Boys, Gondolia is happy and peaceful again very soon.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah! Is the Beastly Boys! You come to give back to me everything you steal from my shop, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Eh? You no have anything to give back to me? Per carit\'e0... Well, maybe I can wait. I work hard and try to sell enough to stay alive in the meantime!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hm? Santo cielo, I nearly forget! S\'ec, allora...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell\par
Ah! Is you! You and your friends help Placido, s\'ec? And now I hear you defeat the Beastly Boys also! Certamente, you are more tough than you look!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell Allora, because of your heroics, many merchants reopen their shop, and now my Papa, he find work at last!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell Is all thanks to you, signore! Grazie mille! You are the saviour of Gondolia!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell I hear about you! I hear you defeat the Beastly Boys! Certamente, you are more tough than you look!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell Allora, because of your heroics, many merchants reopen their shop, and now my Papa find work at last!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell Is all thanks to you, signore! Grazie mille! You are the saviour of Gondolia!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell You have the new friends, signore? Bravo! I am happy for you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell And the things they carry... Cos\'ec curioso! So colourful! I want one too, per favore!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: After you defeat the Beastly Boys, many merchants start to trade again. Is now my job to repair the broken stalls.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is such a relief. Not only for me, but for my wife and boy, also. Now I work hard to give them an happy life!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell Ah! The man of the hour, s\'ec? I hear you decide to take the Beastly Boys under your wing and teach them the right way to live. How noble! Che nobile!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell\par
And as for you, ragazzi pazzi, you no cause the trouble for Signor Sylvando, you hear? Is your last chance to behave!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is true, signore? You decide to help with the riabilitazione of the Beastly Boys?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahhh... Is impossibile. Not only you are strong and brave and handsome, you have an heart of gold too!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can trust you, s\'ec? Bene, then I tell you a secret. You know the black armour in the shop of my brother? I have the same armour in my shop also.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How is this possibile, you ask? Well, I hear that monsters attack a certain kingdom, and all is ruined. Perhaps both suits are plundered from the wreckage, eh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is only a rumour, of course, but still I feel sad when I think about such a tragedy... Molto triste...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It still doesn't seem possible. How could some wandering minstrel get the better of the Beastly Boys when I tried ten times and failed...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now the Beastly Boys are no beastly any more, I feel is safe to go to fish again.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The sea, is still full of monsters, but perhaps is a good thing. Maybe I catch something new and tasty!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are the entertainer who try to make the Beastly Boys behave, s\'ec? Then I think you need a rest...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You take the Beastly Boys under your wing, s\'ec? Bene. I no forget the bad things they do, but they are good ragazzi really.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I pray that they find the righteous path and stay on it forever. Allora, how can I help you today?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You make friends with the Beastly Boys, eh? Uffa... They do the bad things, but I am no one to talk...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Maybe is no easy to teach them to be good, but I have faith in you, signore. Buona fortuna\f1\emdash\f0 and come by for a drink any time!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everything feel so much more bright in Gondolia after the Beastly Boys abandon their wicked ways.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Naturalmente, Placido is an happy bunny also. He miss to play outside so much!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Doge Rotondo\cell I hear you decide to turn the Beastly Boys into the fine young men. Is very noble decision. Molto nobile!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Doge Rotondo\cell As for Gondolia\f1\emdash\f0 ohib\'f2! All our worries do not go away just yet, but at last we have a little bit of hope.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Doge Rotondo\cell Now we must work hard to make sure we no lose this hope, and do all we can to make our town an happy little town again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell Buongiorno, Signor Sylvando! And you, Signor... Eh... In the pink mask. And you also, Beastly Boys!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell Aha ha ha! Is so nice to see people who fight against each other make friends! Un'ispirazione! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell Every time I see your smile, signore, I feel hopeful about the future. Is like magic. I can no explain it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm sorry, but I can't let you pass. It's become far too dangerous after Yggdrasil fell.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you go in, you might never come out. I can't be having that on my conscience.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You can now choose which of Sylvando's new friends will fight alongside him in battle!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm sorry, but I can't let you pass. It's become far too dangerous after Yggdrasil fell.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you go in, you might never come out. I can't be having that on my conscience.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Come on, Sylv! You know 'ow I feel about dark an' dingy places. I said I'd follow you anywhere, an' I will...just not there, alright?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell 'Ere, Sylv, I've been finkin'. You remember that fella we met over near Gallopolis\f1\emdash\f0 the one from the circus?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Well, for some reason, I can't stop finkin' about 'im. 'E looked like 'e was 'aving a proper 'ard time of it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Why don't we go an' see 'ow 'e's doin' before we 'ead to 'Otto? It'd put me mind at ease\f1\emdash\f0 'is an' all, I reckon.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Head for Gallopolis right away?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Right you are, then! Gallopolis, 'ere we come!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Looks like we've 'elped everyone 'oo needed 'elpin' 'round 'ere, Sylv!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Why don't we swing over 'Otto way an' see 'ow Tetsu an' 'is old mum are gettin' on?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Unless you've got any more 'eroics planned? If you do, I'm wiv you all the way!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell That's an 'ole load o' smiles we've put back on people's faces now! Reckon we've done all we can 'round these parts, Sylv!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Why don't we 'ead over to 'Otto an' see 'ow Tetsu's gettin' along? We did promise we'd visit!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The door won't budge an inch.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell What the\f1\emdash\f0 !? Ewww! Is that...bird poo!? Look at how much of it there is! We did hear about huge birds around here though, right?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Sylvando manages to acrobatically avoid being covered in droppings...but spills all the milk from the cow in the Laguna di Gondolia in the process!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Well, what d'you say, Sylv? If yer all done wiv 'elpin' people for now, shall we 'ead into 'Otto?<yesno 2>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Fair enuff! S'pose there might still be some people out there wot need smiles puttin' back on their faces. Come on, then!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Righto! 'Otto, 'ere we come! Let's 'ope Tetsu's 'ome, eh...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell 'Ere we are, then! 'Otto at last! Ready to 'ead in, Sylv?<yesno 2>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Cor, you really don't wanna leave anyone be'ind 'oo might not've 'ad the smile put back on their face, eh? Fair enuff!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell I'm wiv you all the way!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh, you poor thing... It breaks my heart to see you like this! If I could\f1\emdash\f0\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh! Hello there! ...Hm? Oh, no! This isn't a monster, I promise you! Well, it didn't start out as one, at least...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: It's actually a common or garden plant\f1\emdash\f0 and a very beautiful one too! It's from the Laguna di Gondolia originally, and it's simply breathtaking when it's in bloom!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Sadly, when the world went to pot and the darkness fell, plants underwent all kinds of metamorphoses and mutations, and even started wandering around causing mischief like this one.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: It breaks my heart, it really does. That's why I decided to try and do something about it. I'm a botanist, you see, and I've invented a special fertiliser that should restore this little fellow to his former glory!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've got almost all the ingredients I need, but there's one thing I'm still missing: horse poo\f1\emdash\f0 the smellier the better!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'd go and fetch some myself, but I can't just abandon my little friend here. I'm worried he'll panic and start attacking passers-by...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Say, you look like a helpful sort! I don't suppose you'd go and get some horse poo for me, would you?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh, don't say that! Please, you have to help us! Would you be so good as to fetch some horse poo? Just one little dollop will do!<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Sure thing, honey! One steaming mound of horse manure, coming right up! We'll have your friend looking fabulous again before you know it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh, thank you ever so much! Now, I don't know much about horses\f1\emdash\f0 plants are my thing, not animals\f1\emdash\f0 but I've heard there are lots of them in Gallopolis. Maybe that'd be a good place to start looking?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Grrryyyaaarrrghhh...\par
YaaarrrggghhhNNNGGGHHH!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell It appears to be rather agitated. In fact, it looks like it might go on the rampage at any moment...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (slurp) Oh! A gooman! Please, you've got to stay away from me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not a bad slime, I'm really not, but recently I've been hearing voices telling me to do things. Things I'm not slurposed to do...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't think I'm the only one ooze been affected like this, either. That plant over there just turned up a while agoo and started snapping and snarling at everyone!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah! I'd know that sweet, sweet aroma anywhere! You've done as I asked and brought me some horse poo, haven't you?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, this is no time for silly jokes! I need that poo to make fertiliser for my friend here. Now, are you going to give it to me or not?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Sylvando gives the botanist the dollop of horse poo he so desperately desires!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The botanist uses the horse poo to mix up a batch of fertiliser. He then applies it liberally to the soil around the base of the plant.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The plant seems to calm down a little...before pulling up its roots and wandering off!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Look at that! It worked! Thank you ever so much for your help! My little friend'll have toddled off back to the Laguna di Gondolia, I'd imagine. Here's hoping he has a nice, quiet life from now on!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Hear, hear! It's so good to know it's not just humans we're capable of helping! All living things need a hand from time to time!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: That's right! Especially with the way the world is now. There must be so many plants out there suffering just like that poor little fellow was... I wish I could help them all, I really do...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Wait! I have an idea! Why don't I travel around with you and your friends? That's surely the best way to help as many plants as possible. What do you say? Will you let me come with you?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, don't say that! Please, you have to let me travel around with you! I won't be any trouble, I promise! Well? Will you change your mind?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Of course, honey! The more the merrier! If there are plants out there that are suffering, it's up to us to step in and save them!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, that's just wonderful! Thank you ever so much! I'll warn you now, I'm not much good at fighting. I do know a thing or two about the natural world, though, and that's always useful!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell A new member joins Sylvando's merry band!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I've invented a special fertiliser that should cure what's ailing this poor little fellow. I just need a bit of horse poo to finish it off!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, I don't know much about horses\f1\emdash\f0 plants are my thing, not animals\f1\emdash\f0 but I've heard there are lots of horses in Gallopolis, so maybe that'd be a good place to start looking?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'd come with you, but I'm worried my little friend here'll go on the rampage if I abandon it... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (slurp) Oh! A gooman! Please, you've got to stay away from me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not a bad slime, I'm really not, but recently I've been hearing voices telling me to do things. Things I'm not slurposed to do...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't think I'm the only one ooze been affected, either. There was a plant over there a while agoo that was snapping and snarling at everyone! It's gone now, though.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But it was really nice and friendly to me when it left. Maybe it was just going through a rough patch. Ooze to say...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Greetings, fellow travellers... (yawn) I am a peripatetic priest. When Yggdrasil fell, I resolved to roam Erdrea, bringing comfort and solace to those who might need it most.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alas, there is only so much that one man may do... (yawn) For every person I help, there are ten that I fail. Their pained voices haunt me constantly... They keep me awake at night...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In fact, I can barely remember the last time that I slept. I am so...(yawn)...tired... I fear... I fear I may be unable to continue my mission...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I was a...(yawn)...boy, my mother would give me a cup of hot milk whenever I couldn't sleep. It always seemed to do the trick. I'm sure it would work now too, but sadly things aren't quite that simple...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You see, the milk my mother gave me was...(yawn)...no ordinary milk. Oh no. She said it had to come from a talking cow.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, as luck would have it, there is a talking cow grazing near here. Sadly, recent events appear to have put her in a melancholy mood, and she can no longer...(yawn)...produce any milk...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Wait! I have an...(yawn)...idea. You're an entertainer, aren't you? Do you think there might be anything you could do to cheer her up?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh. Very well. I'll just have to soldier on without...(yawn)...sleep for a little while longer, then...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Leave it to us, darling! We'll have a smile on that cow's face in no time flat\f1\emdash\f0 she'll be making milk like nobody's business before you know it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, thank you! Thank you ever so much! She should be grazing just to the west of here. Good luck!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
