\pard\intbl\cell *: You see, the milk my mother gave me was...(yawn)...no ordinary milk. Oh no. She said it had to come from a talking cow.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
