\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've tried my best, but nothing I do seems to cheer her up. A professional...(yawn)...entertainer might fare better, though... Would you be willing to give it a try?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh. Very well. I'll just have to soldier on without...(yawn)...sleep for a little while longer, then...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
