\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell I reckon the same trick'd work on this one 'ere an' all. It's gotta be worth a try, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
