\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Did someone say song and dance? I think that can be arranged! This bovine beauty's in for the show of a lifetime!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
