\pard\intbl\cell *: Woohoo!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Sylvando and co. give it their all, and put on the performance of a lifetime to perk up the poor, sad cow!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: M-Mooo...? I... I feel better! The gloom is lifting! ...In fact, I feel udderly fabulous!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you, my friends! That was... (sniff) Very mooving. I feel much better now! Here, please take this by way of thanks. Moooooo!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
Sylvando receives a pail of fresh milk!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Nice one! Now we got some o' that special milk the priest 'oo couldn't sleep wanted! Let's go an' give 'im a glug or two, shall we?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My mother always gave me milk from a talking cow\f1\emdash\f0 she said no other kind would help me sleep. Luckily...(yawn)...I found such a creature just to the west of here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Unfortunately, recent events have made her ever so...(yawn)...melancholy, and she's not producing any milk at the moment.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I tried to cheer her up myself, but I didn't have any luck. A professional...(yawn)...entertainer like you should fare better, though...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'd be ever so grateful if you could find a way of getting me some milk from the talking cow I found near here...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Give the pail of fresh milk to the priest?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I could have a cup of the milk that my mother used to give me as a child, I'd be able to...(yawn)...sleep again, I just know it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, my word! This is it! This is the milk that my mother used to give me! I don't believe it! Thank you! Thank you so much!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm sure I'll finally be able to get some sleep once I've had a cup of this, but is that really alright? I mean, there are so many people who still need help...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Darling, please. Don't be so hard on yourself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell If you want to help other people, first you've got to look out for number one. You can't do anything for anybody if you're half-asleep.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yes... Yes, you're right.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Feeling guilty about everything I've failed to do won't get me anywhere\f1\emdash\f0 and it won't help anyone else, either.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I suppose I've always known that deep down... But now I see it clearly, and it's all because of you. Thank you. I mean it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh honey, don't mention it! Now come on, get some milk down you so you can sleep. We'll keep an eye out for monsters, don't worry!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Sylvando and co. watch over their new friend as he falls into a deep and peaceful sleep.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Then morning comes...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Moooooo! The clouds have cleared! I'm in a much better moood now, and it's all thanks to you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I haven't slept that well in years! Goodness me, I feel so much better! And what's more, I've come to a decision.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've realised that I'll be able to help a lot more people if I join forces with you. After all, there's only so much one man can do by himself.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So what do you say? Will you allow me to come with you?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, you have to reconsider! Just think of all the happiness we'll be able to spread! Please! You'll let me join you, won't you?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Of course, darling! Helping people's what we're all about!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, thank you! Thank you ever so much! This is going to be wonderful, I just know it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell A new member joins Sylvando's merry band!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: \'a1Por favor! Please! You must help!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Alright, alright, take it easy! Wot's got into you, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Look! Over there! \'a1Por ah\'ed!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am a caballero from Puerto Valor. I heard that very many people were suffering after the fall of Yggdrasil, so I felt it was my duty to try and help them.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ay, but being a hero is much harder than I realised! When I saw these monsters, I froze with fear, and now I can do nothing!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is shameful to ask, but I have no choice... Por favor, se\'f1or\f1\emdash\f0 will you help these people in my place?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ay... But se\'f1or, you must... I am frozen with fear... You must help them! You will, won't you? Please?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell ...It's your lucky day, darling! When it comes to biffing bullying beasties, there's no one like the Great Sylvando!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Muchas gracias! You are a very courageous hombre! I...am not, so I will have to stay here until you are done. Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Greetings, good sir. You may be wondering what a bard is doing in a place such as this. Well, the truth is that I set out on a journey to inspire the world through the medium of rhythm and rhyme.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alas, I am learning that music is a far more subjective matter than I had thought. Not so long ago, I was forced to perform for a group of dancing monsters who had no appreciation for my work whatsoever.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? Where was this? Oh, it was south of Gallopolis\f1\emdash\f0 not a place I shall be visiting again. Do be careful, should you have cause to venture there!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Step, one-two-th\f1\emdash\f0  Hey! What are you doing!? You're ruining our rhythm!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We get very angry if we get out of step! And you don't want to make us angry...do you?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good! Now shuffle off and let us get back in the groove!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell That's enough of your artless prancing! We'll teach you to pick on poor, innocent people!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, so it's like that, is it? Can't bear to see someone with groovier moves than you? Well, come here and let us give you a little dancing lesson!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
