\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is shameful to ask, but I have no choice. Por favor, se\'f1or\f1\emdash\f0 you must help those people.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please help us! These dancing monsters are just horrible!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: These horrible monsters accosted us and subjected us to their awful dancing, and now they won't let us go! Please, you have to help us!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I really thought we were done for when we ran into those monsters. Thanks ever so much for stepping in when you did!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you very much for helping us, mister! We're going home now. Bye-bye!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The mother and daughter set off on their journey home.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Muchas gracias, se\'f1or. I really thought I would be able to help them, but...in the moment, all my confidence disappeared.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Well, at least you tried to do the right thing, honey. \lquote Serving the weak untiringly\rquote  and all that, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bfQu\'e9? You know the Pledge? But how!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, it's just something I heard, long, long ago. It stuck with me, though...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell And whatever happens, you mustn't forget it either. Serve the weak untiringly! Never retreat in the face of adversity! And all that other stuff!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S-S\'ed... I understand...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell And don't be so hard on yourself! Sure, maybe you didn't get to be the hero this time, but at least you tried! You'll make a fine knight one day, I'm sure!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: G-Gracias, se\'f1or. You are a truly wonderful person. In fact, you remind me of my master. The one who inspired me to become a caballero in the first place. You have the same strength. The same spirit...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Por favor, se\'f1or! You must become my new master! I could learn so much from you! Please, will you allow me to accompany you on your adventures?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I understand that I am forcing myself upon you, but I promise that you will not regret this! Por favor, se\'f1or, you must allow me to join you!<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, who am I to stand in the way of a young caballero who wants to fulfil his destiny? You're more than welcome to join us, darling!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Gracias, se\'f1or! I will honour the Pledge and make you proud, I promise!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell A new member joins Sylvando's merry band!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh wow! It's you, isn't it? You're the Great Sylvando!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I sure am, honey! And who might you be, hm?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh, I'm nobody\f1\emdash\f0 not yet, anyway. I just joined the circus in Gallopolis, you see. Oooh, the others aren't going to believe this! It's such an honour to meet you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You're the reason I chose the life of the entertainer, you know! One look at you in action, and I knew what I wanted to be! I ran away and joined up as soon as I could!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, stop it! You're making me blush! But wait...if you're in the circus in Gallopolis, what are you doing all the way out here?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Well, to cut a long story short, we're closing down. Nobody wants to see people clowning around when the world's the way it is. But we're doing one last performance first\f1\emdash\f0 got to go out with a bang, right?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Trouble is, we don't have enough people to pull off what the ringmaster's got planned.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So that's why I'm out here\f1\emdash\f0 I'm on the hunt for people who want a taste of showbiz before it's too late!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Sadly, there don't seem to be many of those around. So, I suppose you know what's coming...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Will you join us for one last big show?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, don't say that! Please, your circus needs you! You want it to go out in style, don't you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh, thank you! Thank you, thank you, thank you! With the Great Sylvando at the top of the bill, it's going to be a night to remember for sure!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ach, but even with you on board, we're still a couple of performers short...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't suppose you could help us look for two more people who'd be willing to join in?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't bother with the desert\f1\emdash\f0 coming out here was a stupid idea. I should have stuck with downtown Gallopolis. There's always plenty of talent there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And with your reputation\f1\emdash\f0 not to mention your powers of persuasion\f1\emdash\f0 they'll be queueing round the block to sign up!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Right, I'd better head back to the big top and start getting ready.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Stop by and see me if you need anything or if you want some advice on who to recruit. Good luck, and thanks again for all your help!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: By the sands! Visitors to our kingdom have been rare indeed since the fall of Yggdrasil. You are clearly made of sterner stuff than most!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The city of Gallopolis lies just ahead, eager to welcome weary travellers. Alas, you must traverse the desert before its pleasures can be enjoyed...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If it is the city of Gallopolis you seek, you must proceed eastward through the desert.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The city can be seen from miles around. You need not worry about missing it. You would do better to worry about the monsters you might encounter on the way...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote WARNING! Monsters roam the desert ahead. Remain vigilant at all times!\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Halt! The Celestial Sands lie beyond this checkpoint, but they are off limits to civilians. Our exalted Sultan's scholars are currently conducting in-depth researches among the dunes.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Celestial Sands lie beyond this point, but they are off limits to civilians. Our exalted Sultan's scholars are currently conducting in-depth researches among the dunes.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The finest minds in the land have gathered in the Celestial Sands on the Sultan's orders. I cannot but wonder what they seek to achieve there...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Gallopolis has been in chaos ever since the World Tree fell.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Furthermore, I have heard that the Sultan spends most of his time in the throne room in consultation with his scholars. What in the world can they be discussing?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hmm... Interesting... But also...impossible! If the star is... No... But... (mutter mumble)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Halt! Visitors are not currently permitted to enter the palace, by order of His Excellency the Sultan!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There can be no exceptions, even for friends of Prince Faris. You must leave now, please.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wait, please! There are no races taking place at the moment\f1\emdash\f0 the paddock and racetrack are currently off limits.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: How can I make her smile again? My drumming seems to make no difference...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell This young man appears to have some talent. Invite him to take part in the circus performance? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Sylvando invites the drummer to join the circus.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...What? The circus? Me!? Well...it has always been an ambition of mine to perform alongside the Great Sylvando...but I'm afraid I can't help you right now.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: It's my best friend, you see. She hasn't cracked so much as a single smile since Yggdrasil fell. I'm sure the right drumbeat would cheer her up, but I can't seem to find it, so I need to practise.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Drumming your fingers to the bone to put a smile on a friend's face? Honey, you're my kind of guy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Say, how about I give you some help. And we'll make a deal while we're at it\f1\emdash\f0 if we can get your friend grinning again, you have to come and join the circus, okay?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Really!? You'll help me!? That's amazing! If you can put a smile back on my friend's face, I'll be happy to join you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: It won't be hard to find my friend\f1\emdash\f0 she really stands out from the crowd. She's got fine bone structure, great posture and these long, fluttering eyelashes...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She was hanging around in the north-west of the city last time I saw her. I really hope you can find a way to make her feel a bit better.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It won't be hard to find my friend\f1\emdash\f0 she really stands out from the crowd. She's got fine bone structure, great posture and these long, fluttering eyelashes...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She was hanging around in the north-west of the city last time I saw her. I really hope you can find a way to make her feel a bit better.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'd be more than happy to join you at the circus once she's smiling again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell It's a pile of hay for horses to rest on. Sit down for a little while?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Gosh... Who knew that hay could be so soft and comfy? It feels just wonderful!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Sylvando's rest leaves him feeling completely rejuvenated!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote IMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENT:\par
As a result of events following the fall of Yggdrasil, all races are cancelled until further notice. We apologise for the inconvenience.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote We regretfully announce that our next show will be our last. Thank you for all your support over the years. We love you all!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote We're currently in the process of recruiting new talent for this final performance\f1\emdash\f0 pop down to the big top for a chat if you're interested!\par
The Ringmaster\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Right! That's two 'ot new talents signed up for the circus! Let's 'ead over to the big top an' share the good news, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Margarita is looking at Sylvando rather bashfully. It seems she's got something to give him...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell ...Hm? What's this, darling?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell G-Gosh... That's certainly quite...fragrant...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
Sylvando receives a dollop of horse poo!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Margarita looks extremely pleased with herself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell It's Margarita, Sylvando's trusty steed. She looks terribly sad, as though she might cry at any moment.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Margarita, darling... Has this awful darkness that's engulfed the world upset you too? Oh, it breaks my heart to see you suffering!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell It's Margarita, Sylvando's trusty steed. She looks terribly sad, as though she might cry at any moment.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Margarita, darling... Has this awful darkness that's engulfed the world upset you too? Oh, it breaks my heart to see you suffering!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell\par
...Wait a minute! Fine bone structure, fabulous posture and long, fluttering eyelashes...! Why, that drummer must have been talking about Margarita!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh! Hello Sylvando!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just came to check up on my friend here. I didn't expect to bump into you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Honey, I had no idea this was who you were talking about! This is Margarita! MY Margarita!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: What!? Margarita is yours!? Well, I suppose that explains why she's so fabulous!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell She certainly is! But you're right about her being in a bad way. I know how to put that right, though\f1\emdash\f0 she's always been a fan of my dancing! You lay down the beat, darling, and I'll do the rest!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Well, I'll try... I warn you, though\f1\emdash\f0 my drumming doesn't seem to have had any effect on her so far. I don't think I've been doing it right...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, honey, there's nothing wrong with your drumming! It's just the visual element that's been lacking, I'm sure! Fortunately, that's where I come in!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell You'll help too, won't you, boys? Let's put our best feet forward and bring a smile back to Margarita's big, long face!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Righto, Sylv!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Sylvando and friends get into a fabulously funky groove!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: N-Neigh... Neeeigh! \f2\u9834?\f0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Margarita is absolutely loving it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh, Sylvando! Look! Look how happy she is! You did it! You really did it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell No\f1\emdash\f0 WE did it! This was a team effort, darling! And now that Margarita's smiling again, we could do with those skills of yours at the circus. What do you say?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: If you really think my drumming can make a difference...I'd be happy to help!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The drummer agrees to perform with the circus!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: By the way, it looks like Margarita wants to give you a little something for making her smile again...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell G-Gosh... That's certainly quite...fragrant...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
Sylvando receives a dollop of horse poo!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Gallopolis, travellers\f1\emdash\f0 and thank you for coming. Few people venture across the sands to visit us these days.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What is more, our exalted Sultan has advised all Gallopolitans not to leave their homes unless absolutely necessary. It is little wonder the streets are so deserted.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And as if that were not bad enough, I hear that the circus is preparing for its final performance. Truly, there is less and less to be excited about every day...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You are asking me to join the circus? By the sands! Now is not the time for such tomfoolery!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do you not understand? We are all doomed! Circuses will not save us!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Prince Faris has been shut up in the palace ever since Yggdrasil fell. I have not enjoyed so much as a glimpse of his fair countenance.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I imagine he must be deep in discussion with the scholars the Sultan has summoned...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You wish for me to join the circus? Forgive me, but it is out of the question. The world is heading for catastrophe, and I am overwhelmed with grief and anxiety.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The idea of attempting to bring joy to an audience in my current state... It is unthinkable. A thousand pardons, but you had better ask someone else.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The fall of Yggdrasil has brought unimaginable chaos to every corner of Erdrea.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Things may appear to be peaceful here in the city, but I fear there may be trouble ahead. It is speculation, of course, but we scholars have our instincts...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The end times are upon us! Yggdrasil has fallen, and the Great Evil will soon be reawoken! I feel it! I feel it in my bones!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The days of peace and happiness are at an end! Soon this world will be plunged into endless despair! Remember my words! Remember them well!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I come here every day to look at the Lantern, and I can see that it is getting closer! It is! Please, you must believe me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What!? You wish for me to perform at the circus? Absolutely not! I am a member of the Gallopolitan army, and I serve our exalted Sultan, not the whims of a baying crowd!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Visitors are not currently permitted to enter the palace, by order of His Excellency the Sultan.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There can be no exceptions, even for friends of Prince Faris. You must leave now, please.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I finally decided to be brave and venture out to do some shopping, but most of the shops are closed...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It has been the same ever since Yggdrasil fell, and the situation shows no signs of improving. There is so little joy in life these days...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: What!? The drummer's worried about me and wants to put a smile on my face!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I think you must be mistaken. We barely know each other.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He's probably talking about Margarita. He's obsessed with that horse...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I saw the dance you did for Margarita! It was amazing\f1\emdash\f0 I loved the funky rhythm too!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I knew our friend the drummer was talented, but that was on another level! Bravo, both of you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I heard that Yggdrasil had fallen, I realised the end was nigh, and so I resolved to gather every penny I had for one final gambling spree. Alas, the racetrack is closed.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It would appear that I am destined to live out the rest of my days without so much as a single moment of joy...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A thousand pardons. I am afraid that the racetrack is closed for the time being. Frivolity is not appropriate in times such as these.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The paddock and stables are off limits until further notice as well. They may never open again...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: By the sands! It is you! The Great Sylvando! We shall never forget what you did for Prince Faris. A thousand thank yous!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hope the racetrack reopens soon\f1\emdash\f0 I would dearly love to see you ride once more!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is the entrance to the spectator stands. As there are no races taking place at the moment, I cannot permit you to enter.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The young hombre who stands in front of the church is the finest drummer in Gallopolis, se\'f1or. Ay, but he has not been the same since Yggdrasil fell...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He is practising harder than ever in the hope of finding a rhythm that will bring joy to an equine friend of his, but I do not think he is having much success...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is a great tragedia, se\'f1or. The fall of Yggdrasil has hit some people very hard. They are shadows of their former selves...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: It seems the next circus performance will be the last. One by one, all Gallopolis's finest traditions are coming to an end...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You would like me to join the circus for their final performance? I am afraid I must decline. I suffer from crippling stage fright. The thought alone causes me to break out in a cold sweat.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is the entrance to the spectator stands. As there are no races taking place at the moment, I cannot permit you to enter.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is the entrance to the spectator stands. As there are no races taking place at the moment, I cannot permit you to enter.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hm? You are looking for a friend of the drummer? Let me think...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I suspect it is a horse you are looking for. He seems to prefer their company to that of humans.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is the entrance to the spectator stands. As there are no races taking place at the moment, I cannot permit you to enter.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh! It is you! I saw the performance you gave a little while ago. It was magnificent!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My working hours mean I am unlikely to ever be able to attend the circus, so it was an unexpected treat to be able to see the Great Sylvando in action!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do I understand you correctly? You wish for me to perform with the circus? A thousand pardons, sir, but this inn will not run itself, even for one night! Speaking of which...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do I understand you correctly? You wish for me to perform with the circus? A thousand pardons, sir, but this inn will not run itself, even for one night!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f2\u9670?\f4\'92\'a9\'82\'cc\'8f\'89\'89\'f1\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yggdrasil may have fallen, but the world is not at an end just yet. Financial prudence is just as important as ever!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hm? You wish for me to join the circus!? Ha! It is an interesting thought, but I could never squeeze into one of those little costumes! I had better stick to weapon selling. Speaking of which...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good day, sir. (cough) I am a priest here in Gallopolis...(splutter)...but I am afraid you find me feeling rather...(cough)...unwell...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You need not worry, however. (cough cough) The nun will be able to attend to all your spiritual needs. Ughhh... (splutter)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our poor priest was injured while protecting a local child from a monster. He has been feeling poorly ever since.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am sure that he will make a full recovery soon, but in the meantime I have agreed to perform all his usual duties. Now, let us pray...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The door is locked from the inside.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Voices can be heard coming from within. It sounds like people are scared to go outside.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am friends with one of the scholars who was summoned to the castle. His advice was to prepare to leave Gallopolis immediately.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You may think me cowardly for abandoning my city in its hour of need, but I must put my family's safety first. I would gladly lose everything to keep them safe.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mother and Father never play with me any more. They are always talking about \lquote grown-up matters\rquote . It is not fair!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What? You want me to run away with the circus? I am sorry, but my career is already decided\f1\emdash\f0 I am going to be a princess!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I heard a rumour that there was a super-talented fortune teller in this tavern, so I sneaked out of circus rehearsals to come and take a look.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm a bit confused, though. Are fortune tellers supposed to juggle? He looks more like a fellow circus man to me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I heard a rumour that there was a super-talented fortune teller in this tavern, so I sneaked out of circus rehearsals to come and take a look. He was here a minute ago, but now it looks like he's left.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm a bit confused, though. Are fortune tellers supposed to juggle? He looked more like a fellow circus man to me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The fortune teller in this tavern's just incredible! He knew I was a dancer before I even opened my mouth!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't be fooled by the juggling act\f1\emdash\f0 that guy's a top-class clairvoyant!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The fortune teller in this tavern's just incredible! He knew I was a dancer before I even opened my mouth!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was going to go and ask him to tell my fortune\f1\emdash\f0 see if there's any hope for me, given the state of the world\f1\emdash\f0 but it looks like he's done for the day.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Greetings, stranger... I sense that you are looking for someone... Ha ha! Do not attempt to deny it! I know everything!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What's more, I am in a position to help you find the one that you seek\f1\emdash\f0 be they a long-lost brother or a brand-new lover, my crystal balls will guide you to them...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't worry, I'm not in it for the money! I just thought that people might need a bit of spiritual guidance, what with Yggdrasil having fallen and all.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell This young man appears to have some talent. Invite him to take part in the circus performance?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Sylvando invites the fortune teller to join the circus.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...You want me to join the circus!? Gosh, even I didn't see that one coming! Are you sure about this? I mean, I'm just a fortune teller. Do you really think I'm going to fit the bill?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I tell you what, why don't we let my crystal balls decide? Now, listen carefully. I'm going to picture one\f1\emdash\f0 and only one\f1\emdash\f0 of these wondrous orbs: red, yellow or blue.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All you've got to do is choose one!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You pick the one I'm picturing, and I'll know we were destined to work together\f1\emdash\f0 I'll come and join the circus without further ado!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Are you all set? Alright, I'm going to start picturing one of them now... Remember, all you have to do is choose which one it is!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh907\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The balls tell all, the balls tell all, what colour will they show us?\par
If lies they tell, then off to hell, that dark place down below us!\par
*: They speak of fire, they speak of flames, they speak of sunset's glow,\par
The balls tell all, the balls tell all, what colour do they show?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alright, I'm picturing one of my crystal balls. Now it's up to you to tell me which one! Are you ready?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The red ball!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *:The blue ball!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The yellow ball!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh dear... I'm afraid that wasn't the one I was picturing. Bad luck!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sorry, but it doesn't look as though our fates were meant to be entwined. Not this time, anyway. Feel free to come back and try again sometime, though!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The red ball... Are you absolutely certain this is the one you want to choose?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well... You did it! You got it right! It looks like we've got some kind of connection!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In which case, my crystal balls and I are at your service. Let me know what you want me to do at the circus, and I'll give it my best shot!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The fortune teller agrees to perform with the circus!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am the finest fortune teller in Erdrea! Be it a long-lost brother or a brand-new lover, my crystal balls shall guide you to them!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't worry, I'm not in it for the money! I just thought that people might need a bit of spiritual guidance, what with Yggdrasil having fallen and all...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What's that? You still want me to join the circus, do you?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, I've got a lot of time for people who don't give up easily. Now, remember how this goes? I'm going to picture one of my crystal balls: red, yellow or blue. You've just got to pick which one it is!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The fortune teller's presence has brought unprecedented numbers of customers to the tavern! I might well have gone bankrupt were it not for him!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The fall of Yggdrasil frightened people, you see. Many refused to leave their homes. It is a bad time to be running an establishment like this. Thank goodness he came along when he did!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That fortune teller breathed life back into my tavern! I am sad that he has moved on, of course, but I will always be grateful to him.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Rest assured that I shall be sitting in the front row of the big top, cheering him on at the top of my lungs. It really is the least I can do!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sorry, Sylv. I can't let you through. Everyone's frantically preparing for our final show, you see\f1\emdash\f0 it's total chaos in there!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Would you mind going round to the main entrance of the big top instead? You can get in through there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh! Hello, Sylv! I hear you've been going round signing up new recruits for our final performance!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And with the Great Sylvando on board as well, we're going to go out with a bang, I just know it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now that we've got the Great Sylvando on board, our final performance is going to be a big hit, I just know it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sorry, Sylv. I can't let you through. Everyone's frantically preparing for our final show, you see\f1\emdash\f0 it's total chaos in there!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Would you mind going round to the main entrance of the big top instead? You can get in through there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well? How's the search for new talent going? Do you need some hints about who to recruit?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Of course you don't! You know what you're looking for! Well, thanks again\f1\emdash\f0 and good luck with the recruitment drive!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alright then, listen up. Rumour has it that the best drummer in Gallopolis spends his days practising in front of the church.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But apparently something's been troubling him of late, so his beats have lost some of their usual people-pleasing power.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, a man who's willing to ignore the melancholy mood of the city to try and put a smile on people's faces is exactly the kind of person we need in the show! Go and seek him out!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've been hearing a lot of talk lately about a fortune teller who's set up shop at the Aloe Beera tavern. Everyone's raving about him\f1\emdash\f0 apparently all his predictions come true!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They say he uses three coloured balls to divine the future. Pretty strange if you ask me, but all his customers seem to be happy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That's exactly the kind of person we need performing at the circus! Why don't you go and talk to him and see if he's interested?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Hello, darling. It's been a while...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: S-Sylv!? What are you doing here!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, you know me, honey. I've never been able to stay away from the circus for long. Bravo, by the way. Most people would have thrown in the towel by now, but I always knew you were made of sterner stuff!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That's nice of you to say, Sylv...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: But to be honest, it didn't even look like we were going to be able to put on this last show until you magically reappeared. Still, things are looking up now you're back on the scene!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's not been easy recently... Most people lost interest in the circus after Yggdrasil fell\f1\emdash\f0 you can't blame them, of course...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I still think it's a shame. After all, people need to smile, no matter how bad things get. That's the way I see it, anyway.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? The circus is staging one final performance? By the sands... It has been so long since I last attended\f1\emdash\f0 but if this is my last chance, I had better not miss it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...The circus's last ever performance? Perhaps this is just what is required to lift my spirits!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am interested in attending the circus's final performance, of course...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I am afraid it is out of the question. I have a duty to protect our exalted Sultan\f1\emdash\f0 neglecting that duty in order to enjoy myself would be unforgivable.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I heard that the hombre who played his drum for the horses has signed up for the circus!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He will be a great success, I am sure of it! His rhythms are perfectly suited to the stage!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Once the circus is gone, Gallopolis will be even quieter than it is now... It is hard to believe that this was once a bustling city, full of life...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The horse is whinnying along to the music and stomping its hooves to the beat!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The horse is whinnying along to the music and stomping its hooves to the beat!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The horse is whinnying along to the music and stomping its hooves to the beat!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah! It is you! The Great Sylvando! I heard a rumour that you will be performing at the circus's final show. I hope it is true. I have always wanted to see you in action!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We are moving house soon. I do not know where we are moving to, but I hope it is a nice place like Gallopolis...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Great Sylvando saves the day once more! We've got two new recruits keen to perform with us in the final show, and it's all thanks to you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everything's ready backstage, and the performers are waiting for their cues. We're all set!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not that we can start without our star turn, of course! Time to prepare for your grand entrance! Let the ringmaster know when you're all set!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sylv! There you are! The new recruits you found for us got here a while ago. Thanks for that\f1\emdash\f0 you got us out of a real pickle.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell\par
Hello, darling. It's been a while...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: S-Sylv!? What are you doing here!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, you know me, honey. I've never been able to stay away from the circus for long. Bravo, by the way. Most people would have thrown in the towel by now, but I always knew you were made of sterner stuff!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Wait\f1\emdash\f0 were you the one who found those new recruits for us as well? Goodness me! I don't know how to thank you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, you don't need to thank me, honey. The only thing you need to do is give me my cue! The Wandering Wonder is ready to leap into action once more!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Alright, Sylv! If you're ready, then so are we!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell That's the spirit! Well, this is it, darlings! One last chance to bring some light into this dark, dark world! One last chance to gasp in awe at the spectacle of the circus! One last glimpse of...the Great Sylvando!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Ha ha ha! Let's get this show on the road!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What a performance that was, Sylv! Just like the old days, eh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How can we quit after a show like that? You saw those people out there! They need us! They need us to bring light into their lives and put smiles on their faces!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Watching you and the new recruits out there has really given me a new lease of life as a performer! I can't give up now\f1\emdash\f0 the show must go on!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm going to keep working hard to become the best that I can be, and I won't stop until Gallopolis is filled with joy, just like it was before!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks for reminding us what the circus is all about, Sylv! It's easy to forget how much people need to smile at times like these!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't worry, we're not going to forget again! You go off gallivanting if you like\f1\emdash\f0 we'll keep the crowds entertained in your absence!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your show was just wonderful! I think it was the first time I have laughed since Yggdrasil fell... I did not think I cared for the circus, but now I realise I am a huge fan!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I did not think anything could prove to be more enjoyable than gambling, but I may need to revise that opinion now that I have been to the circus!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sorry, Sylv. I can't let you through. We're unpacking all the circus stuff, you see. There's boxes everywhere!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Would you mind going round to the main entrance of the big top instead? You can get in through there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It looks like the circus won't be shutting up shop after all, and it's all thanks to you, Sylv! Thank goodness you turned up when you did!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You can leave it in our hands now. You need to go and spread that infectious smile of yours around the world!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sorry, Sylv. I can't let you through. We're unpacking all the circus stuff, you see. There's boxes everywhere!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Would you mind going round to the main entrance of the big top instead? You can get in through there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote We regretfully announce that our next show...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Can't come soon enough! Here's to many more years of laughter and tears! We love you all!\par
The Ringmaster\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: By the sands! It is you! The Great Sylvando! I saw you performing at the circus\f1\emdash\f0 undoubtedly the best such performance I have ever witnessed!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, you must come back and do another show. We will be waiting!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I confess, the fall of Yggdrasil had caused me to forget about the very concept of having fun...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank the sands that you and the circus were here to remind us! I know where I shall be heading next time I am feeling blue: directly to the big top!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Prince Faris has still not shown his handsome face, but I no longer feel as desolate as I did before.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is wonderful, is it not, what a few hours at the circus can do for one's well-being?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A thousand pardons. My guard duties meant that I was unable to attend the circus.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank the sands that they have decided not to call it a day after all! I will be visiting the big top as soon as my shift ends!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am not afraid to admit it, se\'f1or: after I witnessed your performance at the circus, I became your biggest fan! \'a1Tu fan\'e1tico m\'e1s grande!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am so relieved to hear that the circus will not be closing its doors! If Gallopolis had lost that on top of everything else...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you, Sylvando, for all that you have done for us. You have raised our spirits and given us hope for the future!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The horse is neighing with gusto, spurring on its fellow steeds!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Gallopolis has known nothing but darkness since the World Tree fell, but you have finally brought a little light into our lives. A thousand thank yous, friend.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sylv! Don't tell me you're whisking that fortune teller away with you! Well, just be sure to bring him back in one piece, alright?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I must not let down my guard, not even for a moment. Since Yggdrasil fell, monsters in this area have become more vicious and cunning than ever.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you are venturing on a journey, be sure to make camp often\f1\emdash\f0 those foul beasts can smell fatigue, and will not hesitate to pounce.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: H-Halt! N-None shall pass! I promised to protect these people, and that is what I shall d-do! (gulp)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Easy there, honey! We don't mean you any harm! Quite the opposite, actually\f1\emdash\f0 we're travelling around looking for people who might need our help.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: What!? You must be mad with the world the way it is now! Mind you, you do look like you can handle yourself... In fact, there might even be something you can do for me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I'm a martial artist, you see, and I said I'd help these people get food for the village of Hotto. Whatever's going on with the world, it seems to have played havoc with their crop production.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Anyway, we were on the way back to the village when we got attacked by a vicious monster. It roughed us up good and proper, and stole all the food we'd collected!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I was supposed to protect them, but I didn't stand a chance against that thing all by myself. If you were with me though, it'd be a different story. So how about it? Fancy going to get those supplies back?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh come on, please! These poor people are going to go hungry! Please say you'll help me... Please?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell You bet, honey! That monster is going to learn the hard way that it can't go around swiping people's dinners out from under their noses!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, thank you! Thank you so much! As long as we stick together, that thing won't stand a chance!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It should be loitering somewhere to the south of Hotto. I'm sure we'll beat it easily, but let's make sure we're properly prepared anyway, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The martial artist joins the party!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: GRURRR HURRR HURRR! MORE HUMANS! MORE FOOD! GIVE, OR I SQUISH! GRURRR HURRR HURRR!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Reckon we've found our grub-pinchin' monster, Sylv. Ready to 'ave a crack at 'im?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our poor people starve.\par
We sought to bring sustenance,\par
But it was stolen!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our cupboards are bare.\par
Our storehouses stand empty.\par
Stomachs are grumbling.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We found food at last\f1\emdash\f0\par
Enough for everybody.\par
But now it is gone...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The beast stole our food\par
And disappeared to the east!\par
You must retrieve it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Sylvando and co. defeat the gigantes! The villagers recover all the stolen food and take it back to Hotto!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you so much for your help. I really couldn't have done it without you. You know, you're really quite something.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Risking your life to help a bunch of strangers like that? That's pretty amazing.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I want to be like that too, but I don't think I've got what it takes yet. ...Hey, maybe if I spent some time with you it might help. What do you say? Is it alright if I tag along for a while?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, go on! I just want to learn from you so I can help as many people as possible! Can I please come with you?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Of course, darling! You'll be the best, most helpful martial artist in the business by the time I'm done with you, just you wait and see!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you so much! This is going to be the journey of a lifetime, I can feel it in my bones!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell A new member joins Sylvando's merry band!\cell\row 
