\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Look, I know you just rescued me from those monsters and all, but taking on Booga? That's insanity.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, if you insist, I guess I can't stop you. He should be up on the third level, where the arena used to be. Just...be careful, okay?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hmm? Skree hee hee! You must have some guts, human, strolling around and slacking off like that!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Maybe it hasn't sunk in yet, but you're all Booga's slaves now. So get back to work! Skrarrrk!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Octagonia is ours now! The monsssters are in charge, and you humans have to do what we tell you! Kee hee hee!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ssso go on! Get yourssself up to the casssino and make yourssself ussseful!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Go on, get mooving! You don't have time to stand around chatting! Humans belong upstairs! Trot on up there and get to work!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Arrroooh hoo hoo! I never thought we'd find a use for you puny humans, but Booga managed it! Good old Booga!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Would you look at that statue? What a travesty! There's more artistic sensibility in my litter tray! Where did they find the sculptor!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, there's only one thing for it\emdash I'm going to have to replace it with something better. If anyone can teach this town some taste, it's me! Just wait\emdash it's going to be grrreat!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still alive, are you? Then you're hyper-lucky. Humans have been dropping like flies since the Lord of Shadows brought down Yggdrasil.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And not only did you survive, you found yourself here, which means you get to spend the rest of your days working for us monsters! Hyp-hyp hooray!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What a let-down this place turned out to be. They told me Octagonia was full of fighters, so I'd been sharpening my horns in preparation for a proper scrap.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But you humans barely put up a fight! You just let us stampede through the streets! Arrroooh hoo hoo! Pathetic!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (flap flap) The older monsssters keep telling me to ssstay away from thisss place. They sssay it'sss protected by sssome kind of holy power.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I'm not ssso sure. I keep hearing children laughing and playing inssside. It sssounds really fun...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: P-Please! I'll go back to work, I promise! Just don't hurt my baby!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Hey, hold on a second! You're a human! Oh, thank goodness! For a minute there, I thought the monsters had found us!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Y-You won't tell them, will you? There's no knowing what they might do!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You won't tell the monsters we're hiding out here, will you? There's no knowing what they might do!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I won't let those stinky monsters hurt my mom! Never!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oi! What do you think you're doing!? Can't you sssee the elevator's in ussse!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now flap off back to work before I call the guards! Keee hee hee!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hold on\emdash who the devil are you!? You don't half look familiar...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah, that's it! You look just like one of the Luminary's little backing dancers!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Of course, I know you're not actually her\emdash she wouldn't be sashaying around here after what the Lord of Shadows did to those light-loving goody-goodies! Ha ha!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Are we all ssset? Alright, up we go then, you disssgusssting lot! Keee hee hee!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And anyone elssse ssslacking off goes ssstraight upssstairs as well! Ssso put your backsss into it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I seriously doubt the elevator can take all this weight, but I'm not about to stick my neck out and mention that to these monsters...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sorry, kid. I can't let you go down there by yourself. It'd probably be the last we saw of you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's something special about the orphanage. Something...holy. The monsters won't come near it. That's why we're all hiding in here.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
