\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And if you bump into Uncle Vince out there, tell him to stay safe and come home soon. All the kids are worried about him!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm frightfully sorry, but I'm afraid I'm not in the mood for chit-chat at the moment.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You see, I dropped my purse while fleeing from the monsters and...well, I don't even want to think about how much was in it... (sniffle) Uggghhh... (sob)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know, I used to be a real rip-off merchant back in the day, but since Yggdrasil fell, no one's got the money to buy the kind o' stuff I was sellin'.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Plus, people have already lost so much. It don't feel right takin' them to the cleaners all over again, so now I'm tryin' to find a better way to make a livin'.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, listen\emdash I don't wanna scare you, but I've heard some really weird noises coming from the upper levels.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Like, clanking and clanging and bashing and crashing. It's freaking me out!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, kid. You're not thinking of taking on Booga, are you? 'Cause you don't stand a chance against that guy.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Most folks\emdash me included\emdash get so freaked out at the sight of him that they can't even get it together to turn around and run away!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, don't get me wrong\emdash we're ready to rise up as soon as there's a chance of it working, it's just...I don't know if that's ever gonna happen...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wear do you think you're going!? This area's off limits for the likes of you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell There's no response. It looks like this machine isn't ready just yet.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell It doesn't look as though the elevator can be used at the moment.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
