\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Get a moove on, you lot!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Booga doesn't like to be kept waiting, you know! Work harder, or I'll gore you good!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Damned monsters, lordin' it over us, workin' us till we drop...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't know what it is they're tryin' to do to Octagonia exactly, but it sure ain't gonna be pretty.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Skree hee hee! Booga's building something really special up in the old arena!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's really going to put Octagonia on the map! People will be flocking here from all over! You humans should be proud he's letting you help with the construction! Skree hee hee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They said they'll let me...take a break when I've...moved a thousand crates... (gasp) Can't be many...more...left to go...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ......\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell There's no response. He doesn't seem to have the energy to talk.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, did you hear the rumours? They're saying anybody who stands up to the monsters is whisked away and never seen again.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Guess that explains what happened to Vince, huh...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Heaven only knows how long I've been working here without a break. They gotta let us take a break soon, right? ...Right?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It seems the monsters have done away with the arena upstairs. I was rather devastated when I first heard\emdash I thought I'd seen my last bulging bicep!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But that was before I saw the muscles on some of the fabulous creatures they've got guarding the place! Golly gosh, if they aren't the equal of any MMA fighter!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've always been a battler, you know? I thought I'd go down fighting. I can't believe this is what things have come to...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's a potion them there monsters can't get enough of. They told me to make sure I stock up the bar with a whole heap of it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But hoowee, if the stuff don't kick like a mule! One sniff near enough laid me out! Something tells me I'll be better off not knowing what's in it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thisss \lquote Fighting Juice\rquote  of theirs is ssseriousssly disssappointing. It doesn't pack a punch at all!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, I know! I'll add a dash of every monssster's favourite potion, and they'll be queueing around the block for a ssslurp!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is just too much. Working from morning to night without so much as a minute's rest? It's enough to kill a fella.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How come I wound up getting tangled up in this mess anyhow? I only came to town so I could see Sinderella and Whambelina in the flesh...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The monsters came to our little city, \f2\u9834?\f1\par
Forced folks to work, oh it's such a pity, oh yeah! \f2\u9834?\f1\par
When are we...ever gonna be free... \f2\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Gah! Those danged critters have stolen my mojo! How am I supposed to keep turning out hits in this kind of environment!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Waitin' tables is a whole heap harder when it's monsters sittin' at 'em! They just eat and eat and eat!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, I heard they'll be lettin' us all go once this construction work's done and dusted, so I guess I'll only need to stick it out a little longer.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Booga says he's going to give all the humans who work for him a special reward when the job's finished! Won't that be a feather in your cap!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just hope you know how lucky you are. Most bosses aren't half as generous as he is\emdash especially when it comes to bird-brained humans! Skrarrrk!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Janice\cell I just don't get it. Why in tarnation would these monsters be wantin' dance lessons from little old me?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? What are you doing hanging around there? Oh, don't tell me\emdash you want to know all about Booga, the master puppeteer, don't you?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, that's a shame. I love talking about Booga! I could have strung you along for hours with tales of how great he is! But if you're not interested, get back to work!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Isn't he just the best? He's the one who pulls the strings around here, and everyone obeys his every word. After all, the Lord of Shadows chose him especially to be one of the Spectral Sentinels!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: One day, I'm going to be just like him. I'm fed up of dancing to other people's tunes\emdash I want to be the boss!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What's with that look, human? Don't get me hyped up, now!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you know what's good for you, you'll accept that Booga's in charge now and start looking a bit more fearful and miserable like everyone else around here!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now get back to work before I hyper-load your schedule so you drop dead from exhaustion!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, I remember you! It's Jade, right? You made it all the way to the final of the tournament.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm the Mayor of Octagonia\emdash well, I was, at least... This place is run by the monsters now. I don't know what'll become of it, but the glory days are long gone...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Wh\emdash !? Where am I...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The commandments of Booga must be obeyed! Those who defy him must remain in Limboo, and fight until they have learned their lesson!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, stand aside and let justice be done! Thine own day of judgement shalt come to pass soon enough!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S-Stop it... Please... You're only making it worse...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You really want to help? Go help those who need it most. Some of the guys they're keeping down in the cells are getting it way worse than me...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Twill be mere moments ere the next victim is brought forth from below to suffer at our hands! Verily, I do clank and clatter in gleeful anticipation!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: THe cEllS wHEre tHe huMaNs ArE kEpT BEtwEEn baTTlEs ARe jUst dOwn heRe.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: EnJOY tHe TAstE oF FReeDOM WhIlE iT LAstS, HUMan! YOu'lL bE LOcKEd uP wiTh THe rEsT Of THeM SoOn enoUGH! GuUurhURhurRRr!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell There's a book called \lquote The Lovey-Dovey Diaries\rquote . Jade takes it from the shelf and has a closer look.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote My dearest, darling, super-smashing Boo! \f2\u9829?\f1  I've been thinking about you, and now my heart's beating so fast, I think I'm going to explode like a love volcano!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote When are you going to wrap me up in those big, strong arms of yours? Tell me it'll be soon\emdash I've already waited far, far, far too long!\par
Yours forever and ever, Boodica \f2\u9829?\f1  \f2\u9829?\f1  \f2\u9829?\rquote\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote My darling! My precious! My Boodica! How I have missed your all-conquering curves! One day soon, I'll sweep you off your feet, just as I've always promised!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote But my sweet, you will have to wait a little longer. We must do things correctly. First we'll use these pages to get to know each other, then I'll ask the Lord of Shadows to officially approve our union.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Then, on the tenth anniversary of our first date, we'll sit together under a starry sky and\emdash oh, my pen quivers as I write this!\emdash hold hands for the very first time!\par
\lquote Can you imagine, my dearest? Can you? Hold onto that thought\emdash treasure it until the day comes at long last!\par
Yours in anticipation, Booga \f2\u9829?\f1  \f2\u9829?\f1  \f2\u9829?\rquote\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell The book contains hundreds more of Booga and Boodica's sickeningly saccharine love letters. Jade pops it back on the shelf with a shudder.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Pray welcome to the kingdom of misery! A land whose only law is that every human must suffer! In these cells do those wicked enough to defy the mighty Booga repay their debt of foolishness in full!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In time, you too shall take the field in pursuit of forgiveness, but until then, get thee to the furthest reaches of this forsaken place and join the rest of your wretched kind!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everyone says Booga's the very devil himself when it comes to the ladies, with partners all over Erdrea, but it's not true! He's actually a real old-fashioned gentleman, and a true romantic!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I mean, he's been courting Boodica for ages, and they haven't even held hands yet\emdash not even during the last dance of the Monsters' Ball! The poor girl must be in hell!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: BOOgA buiLt ThIs PLaCe fOr His BElOVeD booDiCA So sHE cOULd PUt THosE WHo defY hIm THrougH a GRIsLy pRogGraM oF PUniShMENt.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: nOW tHaT'S TruE LOvE! YoU fICKlE hUMAnS COUld lEaRn a leSSoN oR tWo FRoM a geStURe LIkE tHat!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You'll never guess what's on the bookshelf in there\emdash a complete collection of Booga and Boodica's love letters! Catnip to a hopeless romantic like me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I only peeked for the briefest of moments\emdash they'd have my guts for garters if they caught me\emdash but now thinking about what gems must be in there's really got me purring!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Folks are being forced to fight for the monsters' entertainment. It's just awful\emdash look at what they're doing to them!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not doing so great myself, if I'm honest...but somebody needs to pray for these poor people.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Huh? Yeah, I'm a priest. I know I don't look it, but we come in all shapes and sizes, you know. You look like you could do with a little divine intervention yourself...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I may not look it, but I'm actually a priest\emdash and you look like you could use some divine intervention...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everything...hurts... Somebody, please... I can't take this any more...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What a life... Thrown into this hellhole, only being dragged out to get beaten to a bloody pulp by monsters...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And to think I came to Octagonia to make a name for myself as a fighter... (sigh) Not even in my worst nightmares did I think things would turn out like this...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: To Booga and Boodica, we humans are just trash, and that's exactly how they treat us.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They don't even give us real food. They don't care at all if we live or die...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Wh-What!? I-Is it my turn again already!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh! You're a human... You scared me so much... I thought they'd come for me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know it's nearly time for the next person to be called, you see. I feel bad about it, but I'm praying that they pick someone else...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: (mumble) Mommy... (mutter) Mommy, please... Come get me... (mumble) I wanna go home...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: W-Wait... I, I heard what you were just talking about...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You really are even more reckless than you look. You don't stand a chance out there, you know.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
