\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I guess you're still new around these parts, huh? You don't know how bad it gets out there. Well, I hate to tell you, but you're about to find out...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
