\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, that's as good a place as any to head for, I suppose. I'll see what the folks on the way have to say for themselves...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Forgive me, Your Majesty, but I cannae allow you tae proceed. There's a private meeting in progress.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Feeling peckish, Yer Majesty? Off tae the kitchen on one of yer wee snack hunts?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, I'll not tell you yer business, you being king and all, but I'd stay up here if I were you. One of the ministers informs me that there's something very important afoot...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yer Majesty, please wait. One of the ministers was looking for ye. He said ye should head tae the throne room.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good day to you, Your Majesty! It's another peaceful day in the wonderful kingdom of Dundrasil, and we owe it all to your enlightened rule! Now, to business...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Och, what's the matter, Yer Majesty? Ye look like ye've seen a ghost!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Anyway, shouldn't ye be heading for the throne room? Ye've an important audience, as I understand it. If ye're late, the Chief Minister'll have yer guts for garters!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: So the throne room is through that door over there. If ye head inside and turn left, ye'll find\emdash\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Och, it's you, Yer Majesty! Well, ye don't need me telling you yer way about yer own palace! Ye'll have to forgive me\emdash I'm new here, ye see.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Are ye busy, Yer Majesty? When ye've finished whatever it is ye're doing, let's play hide-and-seek again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I'm good and practise hard, I'll grow up tae be as big and strong as Sir Irwin, won't I, Yer Majesty?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Och, well if I cannae be as tough as the toughest knight in the kingdom, I'll have tae make do with second toughest!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hee hee! I knew it! I cannae wait tae grow up now!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, there ye are, Yer Majesty! The Chief Minister is waiting for ye by yer throne. Perhaps ye can retire tae yer chambers after ye've spoken with him?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, and dinnae worry\emdash I've been keeping a careful eye on yer fine collection of gentleman's literature! The maids won't be throwing it away on my watch!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm sorry, Yer Majesty. Princess Eleanor would tear strips off me if I let anyone intae her private chambers!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ye just missed her, actually. I wonder where she was off tae...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah, there you are, Your Majesty! I've been looking for you everywhere! You must remember me telling you that you had an important audience scheduled!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's almost time! Hurry on over to your throne and prepare yourself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's almost time! Hurry on over to your throne and prepare yourself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You've no business with the Queen's throne just now, Your Majesty! Hurry on over to your own!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Quickly! They'll be here any moment!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell Take a seat until the audience begins?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good day, Yer Majesty! The Chief Minister is waiting for ye in front of the throne. Just head straight on and ye'll see him.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: So he's finally summoned the courage to do it, has he?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Oh! Your Majesty! I didn't see you there! I hope you're keeping well!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I've heard he's finally going tae do it! Ye know what I'm talking about, don't ye?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Oh, Yer Majesty! We were just discussing, umm...nothing! Nothing at all! Hee hee!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yer Majesty, I have tae compliment ye on yer fine choice of cloaks. The one ye've picked today radiates authority like nobody's business!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yer Majesty, is it my imagination or is yer crown particularly resplendent today? It sets off yer regal whiskers tae a T!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yer Majesty! The Queen needs quiet and rest right now, and plenty of it. I know ye want tae see her, but please, give her some space.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What's that!? Ye just gave them permission tae wed!? Yer Majesty! I understand ye're anxious, but please get a grip on yerself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your Majesty! What are you doing here at a time like this!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? You were just in the middle of giving Queen Eleanor and King Irwin permission to marry? Umm... Are you quite sure you're alright?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's to be expected, I suppose. The lucky father-to-be himself rushed out in a panic not too long ago. Honestly, the both of you are as bad as one another!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah... Ah... Ah-CHOO!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Forgive me, Yer Majesty! The maid who brings yer dinner dropped a pot of pepper, and now I cannae stop sneezing!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just hope none of it drifts intae the Queen's room. I'm sure she's having a hard enough time of it already. Ah-Ah-Ah...CHOOO!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I cannae be the only one with an itchy nose, can I?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah, Yer Majesty! It's almost time! I bet ye cannae wait tae meet yer new grandchild! It'll be the bonniest baby ever born, I'm sure of it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yer Majesty, is everything alright? Ye're looking a wee bit befuddled, if ye dinnae mind my saying so.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that ye say? Queen Eleanor and King Irwin lost forever more? Och, come now! It's the nerves talking, that's all!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Speaking of nerves, the father-tae-be seems more than a little jumpy himself. He went flying out of the throne room not long ago like a man possessed!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl King Irwin\cell\par
There you are, Lord Robert! I was hoping I might have the chance to speak with you about something before the child was born.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell\lquote Before the child was born\rquote ...? Well, now... So it's the day of my grandson's birth, is it...? Now there's a thing...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl King Irwin\cell Y-Your Majesty?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell ...Sorry, lad\emdash ye were saying there was something ye wanted to discuss?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl King Irwin\cell Aye. It's the child's name. I've been having trouble thinking of anything suitable.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl King Irwin\cell So much trouble that it's been distracting me from everything else, if I'm honest...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl King Irwin\cell I was wondering if you might see your way to reprising your role as king for a wee while so I can have some time to think it over?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl King Irwin\cell Please, Your Majesty. There's no one else I can ask. You'll be doing myself and your kingdom a great service\emdash you'll do it, won't you?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl King Irwin\cell Thank you! Thank you so much! You'll not have much to do, I promise. There are just two items on the agenda for today...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl King Irwin\cell The first is something you're more than used to\emdash receiving those who seek a royal audience and giving them counsel. The Chief Minister will be on hand to help you with the most pressing issues.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl King Irwin\cell The second is to make the rounds of the castle and assist anyone who needs your aid. The idea of the King aiding his subjects directly was, of course, something you yourself initiated during your reign.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl King Irwin\cell I'll be by the fountain downstairs\emdash it's where I do my best thinking. Once you've taken care of the day's business, please come and find me. I'm truly grateful to you for agreeing to do this.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yer Majesty! The Queen needs quiet and rest right now, and plenty of it. I know ye want tae see her, but please, give her some space.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Hang about, this isnae where the King parks his backside! He sits on the next one over! It's been so long, I'd clean forgotten!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, it seems that's my allotment of visitors for the day. I'd better have a wee wander round the castle and see that there's no one who needs my help.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, it seems I've no more visitors and there's no one else in the castle who needs my help. Which means it must be time to see how Irwin's getting on...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell This is the seat from which the King performs his royal duties. Sit down and get to work?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, it seems that's my allotment of visitors for the day. I'd better have a wee wander round the castle and see that there's no one who needs my help.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, it seems I've no more visitors and there's no one else in the castle who needs my help. Which means it must be time to see how Irwin's getting on...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, it doesnae look like there's anyone else in the castle in need of help...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Which means all I need to do is nip to the throne room and dispense a wee bit of wisdom, then I can go and see Irwin.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, it doesnae look like there's anyone else in the castle in need of help...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell And I've been and dispensed my infinite wisdom in the throne room too, which means it's time to go and have a wee word with Irwin. He said he'd be by the fountain...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, let us commence with today's itinerary. As you know, your role is to hear out those who come before you, and use your wisdom to give counsel as the representative of the crown of Dundrasil.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your Majesty, let me first express to you my gratitude for granting me this audience. I have travelled all the way from the kingdom of Sniflheim to seek it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The matter I wish to bring before you today has been greatly exercising the ruler of my land. He very much desires to seek the counsel of the crown of Dundrasil, paragon of peace and prosperity.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Go on...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It regards a royal treasure that has been handed down from generation to generation of our royal line. It is known as the Blue Orb, and alas, it has vanished, presumed stolen.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: King Gustaf has used every means at his disposal to try to identify the thief and recover this most precious heirloom, but to no avail.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: However, a list of likely culprits has been identified\emdash four, to be precise. Sadly, there is insufficient evidence to conclusively identify the thief. And so, we find ourselves at an impasse...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell So ye need to whittle down your list of suspects, but ye've no clear means by which to do so? Alright, let's have a wee think...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell The first thing is to identify the likely motive. What reason might a person have to want to get their mitts on this Blue Orb?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell For the money.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell For the excitement.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell A treasure like that would bring in a pretty penny, I'll warrant. Aye, that'll be why the thief did it. Now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell The world's full of bad eggs who love nothing more than doing wrong for wrong's own sake. They get a sick thrill out of it. Aye, that's sure to be why they did it. Now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Next, we've tae consider the matter of means. Ye cannae just walk in off the street and help yerself tae the pride of the royal treasure house. So what kind of person could've done it?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell An expert lock picker.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell A master of disguise.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, ye couldnae break into the kind of place they'd keep something that valuable unless ye'd picked a lock or two in yer time. Which leads me to conclude...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, that'll be it. The thief must have disguised himself as a guard or suchlike and strolled right on in without anyone looking at him twice. Which leads me to conclude...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell\par
...That our culprit is a professional thief who did it for the money!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell So what I recommend doing is lining up the suspects, telling them that it turns out the Blue Orb isn't worth a thing, and taking a good, hard look at their faces when ye do so.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Once they hear that they risked everything for a useless bauble that isnae worth a penny, the thief's face will turn to thunder, ye can be sure of it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A marvellous display of deductive reasoning, Your Majesty! With your blessing, I shall return to Sniflheim and inform King Gustaf of your counsel! This is your final judgement on the matter, I take it?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I see. So there are further lines of inquiry you wish to pursue? Very well. I look forward to hearing what they might be.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, it's always best to be thorough with these things. Let's think it through again from the start, shall we?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell\par
...That our culprit is an experienced professional thief!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Go back and line up your suspects. Tell them that the orb they stole was a fake, and that whoever took it must have been an amateur and a fool!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Any innocent party will surely see the funny side, but one person certainly won't crack a smile\emdash the veteran whose skills ye've called into question.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A marvellous display of deductive reasoning, Your Majesty! With your blessing, I shall return to Sniflheim and inform King Gustaf of your counsel! This is your final judgement on the matter, I take it?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
