\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The kingdom of Sniflheim owes you a great debt, Your Majesty! I shall journey back there immediately and share your shrewd insights with the King!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell The envoy from Sniflheim hurries home looking very pleased indeed!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I must commend you on your wise counsel, Lord Robert. Your advice will doubtless lead to the unmasking of the rogue who stole the treasure. Now, shall we move on to the next matter?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Very well. Return here to the throne room and resume the seat of authority when you wish to continue with your royal duties.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Very good, Your Majesty. Then without further delay, let me present you with the next problem requiring your attention...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Sultan of Gallopolis salutes the mighty kingdom of Dundrasil and all its people, and sends this, a missive penned by his most exalted hand! Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Your Majesty, I trust that this message finds you well. Word of the continued triumphs and glories of your kingdom reaches us on a daily basis.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote In truth, I write seeking your counsel for this very reason\emdash as you may know, the sultanate has suffered a prolonged heatwave. The land is parched, and we fear for this year's harvest.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote As ruler of a realm of plenty, I beseech you, share with us the secrets of your prosperity, that we might avert disaster. I await your reply by return of rider. Your humble servant, the Sultan of Gallopolis.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...The message ends there. I do not wish to pressure you, Your Majesty, but His Excellency the Sultan was most desirous of a swift response.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Och, it sounds like they've got themselves in a pretty pickle over there, eh? Well, I'd better see what I can do to help then, hadn't I?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Drought-prevention advice, eh? Hmm... Can't say it's a problem we've ever faced over this way, if I'm honest...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, let's start with the basics, shall we? If I'm to write a reply, I'll need to decide on the tone of the letter first...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell Unfailingly gracious.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell Somewhat stern.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, that's probably the best way to go, eh. Now to the tricky part\emdash what to do in a drought. Let's weigh up the options...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell Offer some conventional wisdom.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell Think outside the box.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell ...Right! That's it! I've got it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Quick, take this down before I forget it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Y-Yes, Your Majesty! Ready when you are!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote My Dear Sultan, I understand that your kingdom is at risk of a severe drought. Put simply, this is a test from on high, and any ruler worthy of the name must be able to rise to such a challenge.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I do not wish to sound unduly harsh, but rather than asking the rulers of other kingdoms for help, you must look closer to home. You must believe in yourself and in your people.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Lead them. Inspire them. Encourage them to till the soil with all their hearts, and new crops shall surely spring forth given time. But you must be strong\emdash you must be a beacon in this time of need.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote My Dear Sultan, I understand that your country is at risk of a terrible drought. Well, fear not, for help is at hand.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote We would be only too happy to open our storehouses and supply you with our surplus grain to make up for any shortfall you may suffer. Naturally, we would expect no compensation.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote For you are our brothers and sisters, and were we ever in the same position, we would expect no less in return. If we cannot come to one another's aid in times of strife, then truly we are lost.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote My Dear Sultan, I understand that your kingdom is at risk of a severe drought. Put simply, there are limits to what one can do in such a situation.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Might I suggest that you take a leaf out of the book of the tribes of ancient times? I speak, of course, of the sacred ritual of the rain dance.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Only the chief of the tribe\emdash you, in other words\emdash may perform it. Belly dance for three days and three nights without rest or sustenance before the den of a dragon. Then, and only then, might you be saved.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote My Dear Sultan, I understand your kingdom is suffering a bout of searingly hot weather. No doubt sales of ice cream and swimsuits are going through the roof!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Of course, I do not wish to make light of your predicament. I simply wish to show you that by changing the way you think about something, you can turn a crisis into an opportunity.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote What I suggest is that you inspire your people to think of radical new ways of cooling down. Leave it to their imaginations and see what they come up with\emdash hopefully it will involve swimsuits, and lots of them!\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell ...That's the one! Get that all written up in yer best fancy handwriting on one of those nice scrolls!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A marvellous missive, Your Majesty, if you don't mind me saying. Now, just to confirm\emdash you're happy for me to write down what you just said and send it off to the Sultan?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Changed your mind, eh? Well, that is, of course your royal prerogative. Let's begin again, shall we?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Excellent! We'll send it back to Gallopolis with the rider right away! Now, shall we have them send in the next visitor?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Very well. Return here to the throne room and resume the seat of authority when you wish to continue with your royal duties.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Very good, Your Majesty! Then without further delay, let me present you with the next problem that requires your attention...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As I'm sure you're aware, there are pugilistic tournaments held regularly in the town of Octagonia where fighters from all four corners of the world compete to prove their worth.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Naturally, there is no shortage of young hopefuls keen to represent Dundrasil in the next grand event of this kind. To that end, I wish to present you with our kingdom's three final candidates.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Who better than a fighting man like yourself, Lord Robert, to assess their potential? If it please Your Majesty, could you step forward and pick the one you think might be a champion in the making?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Where are you going, Your Majesty!? Please engage each pugilist in conversation and choose the one you wish to represent the kingdom!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A fine choice, Your Majesty! I knew a discerning eye like yours would sort the champs from the chaff! Your pick is brimming with brute strength\emdash he can shred steel with his bare hands!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ye're pickin' me, are ye? Eh, that's pure deid brilliant, that is! Ye won't regret it\emdash my opponents will, though! Hurgh hurgh hurgh! So we're good to go, aye?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Gah, make yer mind up, will ye! Ye got me all worked up there! Well, ye'll regret not pickin' me, I'll tell ye that for nothin'.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Amazin'! I won't let ye down, I promise! I'll tear those daft wee nyaffs limb from limb and do Dundrasil proud, just you wait and see!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Marvellous work, Your Majesty. So just to confirm, you're happy to put this hard-hitting specimen forward to represent Dundrasil?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ach, for\emdash ! Ahem... Very well, Your Majesty. Then could I trouble you to make another selection?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Very good, Your Majesty. Victory for Dundrasil is assured! All we need to do now is await our triumphant victor's return!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A typically discerning choice, Your Majesty! This fellow is blessed with that rarest of fighting talents\emdash luck. He's made it through all of his qualifying bouts without conceding a round.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I, I'm afraid I'm not exactly b-brimming with confidence, Your Majesty. But if you p-pick me, I'll c-c-cross my fingers really, really hard and hope for the best! So come on, what d-do you say?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh. I don't blame you, to be honest. I mean, who picks a ninety-seven-pound weakling to represent their kingdom? Ah, well. I guess my luck finally ran out...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Woo-hoo! Seems my luck hasn't run out yet! Thank you so much for giving me this opportunity, Your Majesty! I'm going to cross my fingers and pray myself silly from now until the day of the tournament!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Fine work, Your Majesty. So, may I confirm that you wish to put forward this fortunate candidate to represent the kingdom?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ach, for\emdash ! Ahem... Very well, Your Majesty. Then could I trouble you to make another selection?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Marvellous! Let us hope that fickle fortune will favour us on the day of the tournament!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: An...interesting choice indeed, Your Majesty. This one's a real wild one, without a shred of decency or compassion for his fellow fighter\emdash an animal who will stop at nothing to achieve victory.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Grrr... I can't bear some of the things people say about me, you know. I'm not that bad, honestly. So, are you going to choose me or what?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Grrr... Oh well. I suppose I'll just have to grin and bear it. This is meant to be a tournament for humans, after all. They're welcome to it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That's grrreat, Your Majesty! Just wait till I tell the cubs!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Very good, Your Majesty. But...are you certain you wish to put forward an animal without a shred of mercy to represent your kingdom?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...I thought as much. Then would you be so good as to begin the selection process again?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, it's your choice, I suppose. I think we can be confident of victory, at least. Surely no one will be able to stand up to our boy's unbridled savagery! Ho ho ho!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, Your Majesty, if you would be so kind as to engage each of the candidates in conversation and pick the one who catches your eye.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: W-Wait a moment, Your Majesty! Y-You're not seriously suggesting...? No, surely not! You can't be p-p-picking me...can you?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Phew! I thought you were serious for a moment there! If you would be good enough to get down to the business of picking your actual candidate, that would be wonderful.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Noooooo! I, I mean, really, Your Majesty? You jest, surely? Yes, of course you do! ...Don't you? Please tell me you're joking...<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank goodness for that! I should have known it was simply your roguish sense of humour! Now, if you could apply yourself to the serious business of selecting the finest fighter...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: B\emdash  I... (sigh) If that is your decision, then far be it from me to question it... (gulp) I shall gird my loins, flex my muscles and...enter the ring with the most brutal warriors in all the world... (whimper)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm happy to report that this concludes all your royal duties for today\emdash those here in the throne room, at least.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But as I believe King Irwin mentioned, there may be troubled souls elsewhere in the castle who require your assistance. May I suggest that you take a little stroll around the grounds?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, but before you depart, allow me to say that it was an absolute pleasure to witness you at work today. Truly, it has been far too long. It's safe to say your kingly judgement is as sharp as it ever was!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It seems you have discharged your royal duties with aplomb, Your Majesty. King Irwin will be pleased. Might I suggest that you go and inform him that your work is done?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And may I also say that it has been an absolute pleasure to witness your fine regal mind at work today. It was just like old times!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your Majesty, the King has apprised me of the situation.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you would be so kind as to take a seat on the throne when you are ready to begin discharging your royal duties.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You will be welcoming visitors from other kingdoms, and dealing with various matters of state, both trivial and momentous.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: King Irwin will be deeply grateful for any assistance you can offer, I am sure. And speaking personally, it will be a pleasure to work with you again, Your Majesty.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am pleased to report that your royal duties here in the throne room are done, Your Majesty.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: However, there may well be troubled souls around the castle requiring your assistance. Why not take a stroll around and see?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Marvellous work, Your Majesty. I understand that you have taken care of all the royal duties for the day.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Perhaps you should go and give King Irwin the good news. I believe you will find him in his favourite spot by the fountain.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ye're looking mighty purposeful, Yer Majesty! Have ye some important business afoot? It's nice tae see ye stridin' round the castle wi' the air of a man in charge again. Takes me right back tae the old days.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your Majesty, you were always known as a wise ruler\emdash one who knew a thing or two about a thing or two. Well, I was wondering if I might be bold enough to make a small request of you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you don't mind, I would very much like to ask you some questions in order to see your formidable intellect at work. So what do you say? Will you indulge me?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh... I see... Well, should you change your mind, I shall be here with my questions at the ready!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Why, thank you, Your Majesty! Now, without further ado, let me set you some posers!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All I require is that you, in your infinite wisdom, supply me with a simple \lquote True\rquote  or \lquote False\rquote  in response to each one. Ready? Here we go!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: True or false: you, Lord Robert, are in fact the youngest of three brothers.<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: B-But Your Majesty, surely you jest! You cannot seriously have forgotten how many siblings you have? No, you are merely teasing me, I am certain of it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know you have always enjoyed a good laugh, but I would humbly request that next time you take my questions seriously, and answer truthfully to the very best of your ability.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Correct! But that was too easy, was it not? Let's give you a sterner challenge for the second question. Here it comes...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: True or false: the Purple Orb is one of the royal treasures of Sniflheim.<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's good...but it's not quite right! The name of the famed orb handed down through generations of the Sniflheim royal family since time immemorial is, of course...the Blue Orb!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know you are trying to conceal the truth about the fathomless depths of your knowledge by deliberately giving me wrong answers, but there is no need to be so humble, Your Majesty!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I beg of you, do not hide your light under a bushel next time! Let it shine bright!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Correct! Bravo! Now, I can tell you want more of a challenge, so let's increase the difficulty a little!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: True or false: the Drasilian sovereign we use as currency in our kingdom is worth ten Drasilian shillings.<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm afraid that was incorrect. Are you sure you aren't doing this on purpose, Your Majesty?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All I wish is to see your towering intellect at work. I hope that you will oblige me next time by proving that you do in fact know the answers.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Correct! I can see that you are champing at the bit in anticipation of more testing questions! Well, let us see how you enjoy this one...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: True or false: the Sultan of Gallopolis has a single son upon whom he dotes excessively.<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh dear, Your Majesty! Surely you are aware that the Sultan has not yet been blessed with a child?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It seems you are unwilling to give free rein to your immense intellect. I very much hope the next time you take on this challenge, there will be no such restraint.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Correct! But of course, that comes as no surprise to you, Your Majesty. You have cruised effortlessly to my very final question...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: True or false: in addition to the four great kingdoms that make up Erdrea, there was once a fifth.<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Such a shame! He falls at the final hurdle! I suppose even a man of learning such as yourself is not infallible.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I sense that you have not shown me the true extent of your formidable wisdom. Should you wish to pick up the gauntlet once more, I shall be only too happy to pepper you with stumpers!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh! You did it, Your Majesty! You answered every single question correctly! But then, I expected nothing less! Truly, I have witnessed an epic feat of intellectual prowess!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I shall never forget what I have observed here today! The sight of a matchless mind spreading its wings and taking flight is something I shall take to the grave! Here\emdash a small token of my appreciation...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
Rab acquires a seed of magic!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This has been both a humbling and inspiring experience, Your Majesty. I intend to hit the books and memorise yet more obscure trivia, that I might one day reach your heady heights!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This has been both a humbling and inspiring experience, Your Majesty. I intend to hit the books and memorise yet more obscure trivia, that I might one day reach your heady heights!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, Your Majesty! Would I be right in assuming you wish to test yourself with my barrage of questions once more?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not long now, Your Majesty! I am quite sure the newest addition to the royal family will be a huge asset to the kingdom! Ah, but you must forgive my excitement\emdash I almost forgot my priestly duties...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Och, I cannae wait for the wee one tae be born! I'm getting that excited, ye'd think it was my own flesh and blood!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good day tae ye, Yer Majesty. If ye're looking for King Irwin, he's in his usual spot by the fountain down below. It looks like he's got a lot on his mind...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I reckon it'll be a wee girl! And with a mother as lovely as Queen Eleanor, she'll be as cute as a button!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just know it's gonnae be a wee boy! And with a dad like that, I bet he'll grow up big and strong!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Forgive me for bothering ye with such a trifling matter, Yer Majesty, but I have a...wee problem I'd very much like tae ask yer advice about.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The truth is, there's someone in the castle who's caught my eye, but I just cannae muster the courage tae tell them how I feel.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Anyway, I had an idea\emdash and I know it sounds like I'm out of my tree\emdash but what if they got flowers delivered by none other than...yerself? I reckon they'd be over the moon! So...what d'ye say?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Fair enough. I suppose it was a bit of a hare-brained scheme. Sorry tae have troubled ye, Yer Majesty.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ye'll do it!? Really!? Wow! I dinnae quite know what tae say! Ye're a star! Oh, before I forget\emdash here they are!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell Rab receives a pretty posy!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, how can I begin tae describe my true love, my peach, the apple of my eye and captor of my heart? ...Well, they're in the castle, they're wearing green\emdash oh, and they've got red hair. Good luck!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hate tae be a pain, Yer Majesty, but if ye could see yer way tae delivering those flowers tae my true love, I'd be in yer debt forever. Go on, what d'ye say?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If ye're having trouble finding the object of my affections, just remember: green outfit, red hair. And they're somewhere in the castle. Best of luck, Yer Majesty!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hate tae break it tae ye, Yer Majesty...but ye delivered the flowers tae the wrong person!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But every cloud has a silver lining and all that\emdash I ended up speaking tae the person ye gave them tae so I could explain the mix-up, and it turns out she's my long-lost mother!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
