\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I thought nothing was more precious than true love, but let's face it\emdash I cannae turn down that much gold, can I? I'm rich, and it's all thanks tae you, Yer Majesty! Please, this is the least I can do...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
