\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good day to you, Lord Robert! I expect you're going to be putting on a lavish party to celebrate the birth of your first grandchild. I do hope I'll be on the guest list!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aye, this is big news alright\emdash the next in line tae the throne of Dundrasil is on the way! Folks from all around the world will be dying tae know if it's a wee lad or a wee lassie.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, Your Majesty! Cometh the hour, cometh the man! We're in the middle of a wee culinary emergency, you see, and we could do with the assistance of someone such as yourself. A...gastronome, shall we say?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A butter-fingered fool of a maid managed to drop the very last pot of pepper from the castle larder, and it smashed and went everywhere.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm sure you can imagine what the guards will say when they sit down to their neeps and tatties and there's no seasoning to be had! There'll be uproar! Please, Your Majesty\emdash help us in our hour of need!<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Och, that's a real shame! Well, if you change your mind at all, you know where I'll be.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Excellent! I knew you wouldn't let us down! Now if you wouldn't mind searching the castle, we need something nice and pungent we can use instead of pepper.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was thinking some of the plants around the castle might yield something useful. It's certainly worth a look, anyway.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But don't restrict your search to plants alone\emdash you never know where the perfect condiment might be hiding. Well, I trust your judgement, Your Majesty. Happy hunting!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's bound to be something somewhere we can use instead of pepper. Have a good rummage round and see what you can turn up. I trust your judgement, Your Majesty! I know you're a man of taste!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Actually, I have a vague recollection of a plant with a spicy smell growing somewhere in the castle. Perhaps you could try sniffing it out?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You did us proud, Your Majesty! Thanks to you, we managed to serve the guards their neeps and tatties with the little extra kick they love!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I had every faith that a man of taste and distinction such as yourself would find the perfect ingredient!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: To be honest, Your Majesty, when you first handed me those berries, I wasn't completely convinced. But it just goes to show how little I know!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks to your superior culinary insight, we managed to come up with an original new twist on neeps and tatties for the guards' dinner.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I must confess, when you presented me with your pepper substitute I was a little concerned, but the cooks worked their culinary magic and came up with an utterly astounding new dish!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We would never have thought of using an ingredient like that in a million years. It took a true visionary such as yourself to show us the way!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
