\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Hmm... I'm sure there are other things ye could use instead of pepper, but this doesnae seem like a bad option to me...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell Put the leaf forward as your suggested substitute?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mmm! This might just work! Aye, I reckon this could make a pretty interesting alternative to pepper. Well, only one way to find out!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I knew you wouldnae let us down, Your Majesty! Here's a little token of appreciation on behalf of all the kitchen staff...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
