\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl Sultan of Gallopolis\cell Your idea of devising new ways for my people to cool down was inspired! It led to a new dance craze that helped keep everyone's spirits up\emdash oh, and swimsuit sales went through the roof!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We have come all the way from Gallopolis to celebrate your birthday with an array of stunning stunts and thrilling skills!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is an honour to meet you, Lord Robert! All Gallopolitans know you as the man who inspired the Sultan to guide us successfully through our time of drought!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It would be no exaggeration to say that you are the reason we are all alive and well, and can be here today. There are no words to express our gratitude\emdash only circus stunts!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is an honour to meet you, Lord Robert. All Gallopolitans know you as the man who offered us your kingdom's surplus grain without asking for any payment in return.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It would be no exaggeration to say that you are the reason we are all alive and well, and can be here today. There are no words to express our gratitude\emdash only circus stunts!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is an honour to meet you, Lord Robert. All Gallopolitans know you as the man who advised the Sultan to perform a rain dance in order to drive back the drought.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It would be no exaggeration to say that you are the reason we are all alive and well, and can be here today. There are no words to express our gratitude\emdash only circus stunts!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What better way to celebrate the birthday of a truly marvellous man than with the most famous circus troupe in all Gallopolis?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Lord Robert, I am your humble servant. If you had not told the Sultan that the drought was a test, and that he must rise to the challenge, we might not have pulled through.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Gallopolis is a place where chivalry and honour are everything. We never forget those we are indebted to, that I promise you. You may rest assured that your name will live on in legend.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Lord Robert, I am your humble servant. If you had not so kindly donated your surplus grain, I shudder to think how many lives might have been lost to the drought. On behalf of all Gallopolis, I thank you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Gallopolis is a place where chivalry and honour are everything. We never forget those we are indebted to, that I promise you. You may rest assured that your name will live on in legend.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Lord Robert, I am your humble servant. If you had not advised the Sultan to perform the sacred belly dance, I shudder to think how many lives might have been lost to the drought.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Gallopolis is a place where chivalry and honour are everything. We never forget those we are indebted to, that I promise you. You may rest assured that your name will live on in legend.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We are the coolest dancers you will ever meet: the Snow Girl Showgirls! Frosty reception guaranteed! So, Lord Robert, what do you say? Would you like to celebrate your birthday in style?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, now that is cold! Ah well, maybe next time? There is no need to be shy!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Brrr! I feel a cold front approaching! Close your eyes, and stay frosty!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Here we go...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Come, let me cool your fevered brow, \f2\u9834?\f1\par
Hold still and I will show you how! \f2\u9834?\f1\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell Rab is engulfed in a blast of delightfully icy air!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So, how are you feeling, Your Highness? Suitably chilled, I hope? I do hope there are no icicles on your eyelashes!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If ever you're feeling hot and bothered, we're the cure! We've come all the way from the burning desert to demonstrate the secret art of cooling down in even the hottest climes! Why not give it a try?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Many happy returns, Yer Majesty! I've brought some of my fightin' mates from Octagonia to help ye celebrate in style!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Many happy returns, Yer Majesty! I've brought some of my fightin' mates from Octagonia to help ye celebrate in style!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, and I wanted tae thank ye again for pickin' me tae represent Dundrasil in the ring. I'm only sorry I didnae manage tae come back wi' the trophy. Guess I wasnae quite as tough as I thought...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, I learned a lot from my experience at the School o' Hard Knocks, and now I'm a half-decent grappler, even if I do say so myself. And I owe it all tae you for givin' me my big break!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hope you're having a wonderful birthday! You know, I'm still grateful to you for picking me all those years ago.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I remember when I went to the tournament, I was scared out of my wits\emdash all the other fighters looked so tough. I thought I didn't stand a chance.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But would you believe it, just before the tournament started, there was a torrential downpour and the whole thing was postponed. In the end, a lot of the toughest fighters caught colds and pulled out!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I managed to win a bunch of my matches by default because my opponents didn't show up! What a result! In the end, I was runner-up and I never had to throw a punch! What a stroke of luck, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Many happy returns! I hope you're having a grrreat day! Oh, and I wanted to say thank you for picking me to represent Dundrasil all those years ago!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: At first, it was pretty grizzly, I won't lie to you. When I entered the ring, the whole crowd booed. It was tough to bear.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But when they saw me in action, it gave them paws for thought. The crowd slowly warmed to me, and by the time I lifted the trophy, they were all right behind me! What an experience!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not many people would have given an animal like me a chance, but you could see that I had something to give. On behalf of me and all the cubs, I want to thank you for what you did!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Happy birthday, Your Highness! What a marvellous occasion! I hope you don't mind, but I invited some young ladies I befriended back in Octagonia.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahh, I have so many happy memories of my time in the ring... When I first went, I presumed I would be fighting mano a mano, so to speak. Instead, it was a battle royale\emdash a veritable free-for-all!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I used my diplomatic skills and discretion to remain above the fray while my rivals slugged it out, and in the mad melee they were good enough to knock each other unconscious, leaving me to claim victory!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Me an' me mates are the finest fighters in Octagonia, an' we came to wish you a very 'appy birthday, Yer Royalness!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Me an' me mates are the finest fighters in Octagonia, an' we came to wish you a very 'appy birthday, Yer Royalness!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, an' if yer wonderin' 'oo let the likes of us crash yer party, it was that big lunk you sent off to represent Dundrasil in the tournament all them years ago. 'E's a credit to yer kingdom, 'e really is!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Me an' me mates are the finest fighters in Octagonia, an' we came to wish you a very 'appy birthday, Yer Royalness!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, an' if yer wonderin' 'oo let the likes of us crash yer party, it was that lucky lad you sent off to represent Dundrasil in the tournament all them years ago. We're still talkin' about 'im, believe me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Me an' me mates are the finest fighters in Octagonia, an' we came to wish you a very 'appy birthday, Yer Royalness!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, an' if yer wonderin' 'oo let the likes of us crash yer party, it was that bloke you sent off to represent Dundrasil in the tournament all them years ago. 'E may look a bit uptight, but 'e's alright!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Happy birthday, Yer Majesty! I came all the way from Octagonia to help bulk up yer party!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hope you don't mind, but I wanted to meet the man who picked the fighter who represented Dundrasil all those years ago. The guy's a good friend o' mine now, ya see.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I didn't see it at first meself, but you chose a bloke with limitless potential. I don't know if anyone's ever told you this before, but you've got a rare eye for folks' inner strengths.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I 'ope you don't mind, but I wanted to meet the man who picked the fighter who represented Dundrasil all those years ago. The guy's a good friend o' mine now, ya see.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Some fighters are just born lucky, and 'e's one of 'em. I'm amazed you managed to see that in 'im, 'cos 'e's not exactly impressive to look at. You've got a rare eye for folks' inner strengths, you know that?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hope you don't mind, but I wanted to meet the man who picked the fighter who represented Dundrasil all those years ago. The guy's a good friend o' mine now, ya see.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm impressed you managed to look beyond 'is beastly exterior an' see that 'e had a good 'eart. You've got a rare eye for folks' inner strengths, you know that?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wow! It's you! It's really you! The legendary Lord Robert, in the flesh! I've heard all about you from your Chief Minister, you know!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I remember when I first saw him in the ring. He was creeping around the place, doing his best not to attract anyone's attention. It was cowardly, but kind of adorable.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Anyhow, he somehow managed to skulk his way to victory. There was a big party to celebrate, and I got talking to him and...well, we've been friends ever since!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Happy birthday, Your Highness! And sorry\emdash I've turned up to your party empty-handed!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Wait, I know! If you take part in the next tournament in Octagonia, I'll make sure to show you my one and only Puff-Puff Strike! You won't know what's hit you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Lord Robert, ye look like a man half yer age! Maybe ye could let me in on yer secret one day?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aye, there's no doubt about it! This is the single greatest party I've ever been tae in ma puff! Now, if ye dinnae mind, I'm off tae search for a wee dram!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The kitchen staff have been working round the clock to prepare all your favourites, Your Majesty! So please\emdash eat, drink and be merry!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Serving you was the single greatest honour of my life, Lord Robert!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aye, Dundrasil's future is assured!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I mean, with Lord Robert, King Irwin and young <pc>, how can we go wrong? You're truly an inspiration tae all of us guards!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: May you be blessed with many more happy, healthy years, Your Highness! Now let us give praise for all we have...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hic! Och, what's goin' on!? I only had a wee drop tae wet me whistle, and now I'm staggerin' around the place... I thought I was made o' sterner stuff than this. Hic!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ye'll never guess whose idea it was to make a cake this big! None other than yer pride and joy, wee <pc>!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is gigantesco, s\f0\'ec? Is the idea of young <pc> to present you with the giant cake. You must try a slice, signore!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
\pard\intbl <pc>\cell Everyone loves you, Grampa! All of those scholars were telling me how clever you are. You're amazing!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10319 
