\pard\intbl Healijah\cell Wait, where are you gooing? You've got to hold them off until I get this thingummy working!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10379 
\pard\intbl Healijah\cell Are you alright? I think it might be slime to make a swift exit...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10379 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Grrraaargh! They're getting away! Get after them or you'll have me to answer to!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10379 
\pard\intbl Healijah\cell Phew! We got out of there just in the nick of slime!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10379 
\pard\intbl Healijah\cell But we need to goo back and get that contraption working. I suppose we'll have to wait and see if things calm down...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10379 
\pard\intbl Healijah\cell Umm, excooze me for saying so, but this isn't the right way. We need to goo back to that room and get that thingummy working!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10379 
\pard\intbl Healijah\cell Gooreat! They've cleared off! Now's our chance!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10379 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oi! There they are! The runaways! They must have thought they could sneak back in while our backs were turned!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10379 
\pard\intbl Healijah\cell\par
