\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cf1\f1\cell *: There's been a bit of a fuss at the castle of late. Folks keep seeing a weird shadowy thing floating about the place.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It doesn't seem like it means any harm, but no one knows what it is, so people are a little uneasy\emdash which is understandable, I suppose.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just heard that it appeared in the garden in the central courtyard. A maid screamed and ran for her life, apparently. What in the world can it be?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm the head gardener here, but I can't get a jot of work done in the central courtyard lately without that blasted apparition popping up to bother me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's not like it's actually stopping me doing anything, it's just...eerie, you know? I wish it would clear off. I've got important weeding to do!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Apparently, some people can see the strange apparition that's been floating about the place, and others just can't.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, I've never seen it myself. To be honest, I'm not even convinced it exists. I think everyone's just imagining it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's been this horrible shadowy thing floating about the courtyard lately. Apparently, it's there right now, on the other side of this door. Well, I'm not going anywhere near it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: .........\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell A dark form hovers in the air under the tree.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell What is that thing? It seems very interested in that tree for some reason. I wonder what it wants...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Wait a second\emdash is it just me, or is that big root thingy wrapped around the tree glowing? I think you should take a closer look, <pc>.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell Reach out and touch the Yggdrasil root?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell It's a large dresser. There's nothing particularly interesting about it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The King has ordered me to clear out Sir Jasper's old room, but I just don't have the heart to do it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I still can't believe it. How could he of all people have been led astray by that demon who possessed our king and the miserable monsters who follow him? And now he's gone...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, I know he chose the wrong path, but that won't change what I think about him. The man I served was noble and wise. He was a great general and a true leader of men.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is His Majesty's chamber, and before you ask, no\emdash you're not coming in. It's being cleaned right now.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell The curious energy that once emanated from the plant can no longer be felt.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's been a bit of a fuss at the castle of late. Folks keep seeing a weird shadowy thing floating about the place.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Apparently, it just appears out of nowhere, floats about for a bit and then vanishes.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It doesn't seem like it means any harm, but no one knows what it is, so people are a little uneasy\emdash which is understandable, I suppose.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That thing just went into the castle! Normally it just vanishes as quickly as it appeared. Did something happen in the courtyard, I wonder?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That eerie black shadow just went into the dining hall. Ugh! Seeing it is enough to turn my stomach!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Th-That thing just floated into the kitchen! I'd heard the rumours, but I'd never seen it for myself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When it went past me, a chill went right down my spine. It's not a ghost, is it? Well, whatever it is, I don't like it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know that black shadowy thing everyone's talking about? Well, it just headed through that door on the left towards the larder.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It seems to like hovering in front of the dresser in there. I'm not sure what it's after, but it hasn't attacked anyone, and it doesn't make the milk go sour, so I suppose things could be worse...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This mangy moggy 'ere's got its tail in a right old twist about somefink. It came flyin' out the larder a minute ago, an' it's been starin' at the door an' growlin' ever since.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I didn't see it meself, but I reckon it must be that black shadow thing everyone's been on about. Must've slipped in there while I weren't lookin'.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
The cat is staring intently at the larder door and growling.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: .........\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell It is gone. Something gave me the sense it was looking at the dresser...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Of course\emdash this is the dresser behind which lies the passage to the King's chambers...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Only two people beside the King have ever known of its existence. I am one...and Jasper was the other...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell When we were boys, we would often get up to no good. We hatched a plan to sneak into the King's chambers, but he discovered it, and reprimanded us severely.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Truly, those were happy times... Jasper and I made a solemn vow that we would protect this kingdom together\emdash and I truly believed that we would...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell ...No matter. Now we are here. And that shade must have led us here for a reason. It is trying to tell me something.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell <pc>, we must go to Jasper's old room. There is something I need to see.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell The dresser wobbles slightly when you touch it. Try moving it?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell Hendrik and <pc> push the dresser to one side.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell This passage leads to the King's chambers. But before we visit them, might I ask that we pay a visit to Jasper's old room?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell It is located on the west side of the castle. There is something I wish to see there.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That spooky spirit thing just floated off towards the dining hall.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It must have got bored of hovering in front of that dresser. I'm not sure what it's after, but it hasn't attacked anyone or made the milk go sour, so I suppose things could be worse...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That mangy moggy's 'ad enough of growlin' at the larder door, so now it's glarin' at the dinin' 'all.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I didn't see it meself, but I reckon it's that black shadow thing again. Must've slipped in there while I weren't lookin'...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
The cat is staring intently at the door of the dining hall and growling.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That weird shadowy thing just floated out of the kitchen and down the corridor. What did it want in the kitchen anyway? It can't have been hungry, can it?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That thing just came out of the dining hall and headed toward the west side of the castle. I'm not sure what's over that way except Sir Jasper's old room...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The apparition just entered Sir Jasper's old chambers!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My duty as a guard is to chase off any intruders, but this is beyond my pay grade.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Besides, it sounds strange to say it, but it seems...at home in there...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ......... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell It's a well-worn journal. The entries are written in a neat hand.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote It is a month now since Hendrik returned from his training in Puerto Valor. In that short time, he has grown tall, and his bearing is now very much that of a knight.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I asked that he spar with me, but I was no match for him. No longer is he merely physically stronger\emdash his sword skills have been honed to an extraordinary degree.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote But it was not his blows that hurt me most. No, it was the way he reached out his hand with a smile to help me up after he knocked me to the ground. Just as he did when we were children...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote While he was training, I was not idle. I threw myself into my studies, devouring tome after tome on military strategy. But it is never enough. Yet again, he has surpassed me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote We vowed to serve and protect this kingdom together. But perhaps he has forgotten this. Or does he view it as a childish promise, best consigned to the past with the memories of all we shared?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote But I have not forgotten. I still imagine us fighting alongside the King to defend the honour of Heliodor. I will not let that dream die\emdash I will do all that I can to make it a reality.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell So this is Jasper's journal. He writes what his pride would never allow him to say. I must confess, I had no idea that this was how he felt...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell I see now that the darkness that consumed his heart had begun to gather much sooner than I cared to realise. I see now how my actions must have hurt him...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell If I am not mistaken, the apparition will appear next in the banqueting hall. Might I request that we go there and see if my intuition is correct?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Wh-What!? It's the Luminary! B-But how...!? How did you get in there!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
