\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote We vowed to serve and protect this kingdom together. But perhaps he has forgotten this. Or does he view it as a childish promise, best consigned to the past with the memories of all we shared?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote But I have not forgotten. I still imagine us fighting alongside the King to defend the honour of Heliodor. I will not let that dream die\emdash I will do all that I can to make it a reality.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That dark floaty thing came out of the room just now and floated down the corridor towards the banquet hall. Just what is it doing, I wonder...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you're hunting for that, that...thing, I just saw it heading towards the banquet hall. Now, if you don't mind, I have important duties to attend to. These stupid spectres don't rattle me, of course... (shudder)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The maid who was cleaning the courtyard suddenly shrieked and said she'd seen that black shape in the banquet hall, but I didn't see a thing.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Maybe it's true what they say\emdash maybe some people just can't see it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I thought that horrible thing had vanished, but it's back, and this time it's in the banquet hall! Why can't someone tell me what's going on!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Normally that shadowy thing appears in some dark corner and then vanishes, but now it's parading around like it owns the place. I'm worried something funny's afoot...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That eerie apparition's back, and this time it's taken up residence in the banquet hall! It seems to be looking at something. Can it really be interested in the two-headed eagle of Heliodor?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everyone's talking about some commotion or other, but I haven't seen a thing. It's just a lot of fuss about nothing, if you ask me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that!? That thing was in here? Stop pulling my leg! I've been keeping watch all day, and I didn't see it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Urgh, that thing really makes my skin crawl! I know a guard shouldn't abandon his post, but I can't stand being anywhere near it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My good lady wife claimed she could see a terrifying black apparition so we fled upstairs, but I think it must all be in her head.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Are you seriously telling me you can't see it!? Look! The black shadowy thing, right in the middle of the hall!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Seeing that thing just makes me feel so sad.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have no idea what it is, but I am certain it is desperately trying to tell us something.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Maybe it's true\emdash maybe some people just can't see the thing.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've been standing guard here all this time, but I haven't seen hide nor hair of it. I suppose I just don't have the gift.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I think that thing's gone upstairs. Hopefully I can get on with my cleaning now without being rudely interrupted.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you seek the black shade, it has gone upstairs.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It seems that it does not mean any harm, but we must be on our guard\emdash it is a little too close to the throne room for comfort.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It sounds odd to say, but it looked like that shadowy form was gazing at the royal insignia over there. I couldn't help feeling that it was lost in thought.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It sounded like something was going on just now. Nothing bad, I trust?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that you say? A shadowy apparition? In here? Ha ha! A likely story! I didn't realise you were such a leg-puller!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just saw that thing going up the stairs. You know, I can't explain why, but something about it just makes me feel sad.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have no idea what it is, but I am certain that it is desperately trying to tell us something.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Waaah! It swooshed right past my face!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Uhh, I mean, I've been neglectful in my duty and let an intruder past! Ahem...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I wonder where that black shadow thing was going...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The proud men of Heliodor shall defend their king and castle no matter what may come to pass! We will remain stoical and composed to the end!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Or so I had always thought. The guards on the stairs seemed anything but calm and collected just now. I hope nothing untoward has happened.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I finally caught sight of the spooky apparition that's got the whole castle talking! It floated up the stairs to the next floor!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Guards on duty must always maintain their composure. And yet my colleagues over on the stairs seemed very vexed indeed.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do they not realise that they are meant to be the pride of Heliodor? They should be ashamed of themselves!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That bothersome shadowy thingummy is on the prowl again. I've seen it on the balcony while I've been on patrol before. I wouldn't be surprised if that's where it is now.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wonder what it could be so interested in out there. Apparently, aspiring knights used to use it for sparring, but that hasn't happened for years.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Are you seriously telling me you didn't see that thing!? It came right out of the banquet hall! It's on the move again.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mr Luminary, sir! Sir Hendrik, sir! That shadowy thing is on the other side of this door, sirs!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't have the faintest idea what it's doing up here. Perhaps it wants to enjoy the view from the balcony?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The sinister apparition that has been haunting the castle seems to have taken up position on the balcony through the main doors.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There is something mournful in that inky-black figure, something that speaks to my muse. Perhaps I shall pen a melancholy ballad once this is all over.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Seeing that restless spirit floating this way and that, seemingly without rhyme or reason, touches something within me. It saddens me in a way I cannot explain.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When will it grow weary of its wanderings? Or is it doomed to do this forever?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, at least that thing's cleared off. I suppose I'd better get back on patrol. Not that I was scared or anything, you understand.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell ...No! This is not over!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell Hendrik's strength is restored!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell I must face him again. Please. Do not deny me this.<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell The darkness that consumed Jasper is one I helped create. Please. I must face him once more. <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl Jasper\cell\par
Why...? Why...? How could this...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell It's Jasper's sword. From its pommel hangs the token of fealty, glinting in the light.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please allow me to sing a classic about Heliodor's most famous victory and the peace that we enjoyed thereafter. I would like to dedicate it to the spirit that now dwells within the sword.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A new dawn has broken, the lark he sings! \f2\u9834?\f1\par
Let us praise the sun, the light it brings! \f2\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The eagle soars in the cloudless blue, \f2\u9834?\f1\par
The healing river flows pure and true! \f2\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Come lift your voice and sing for Heliodor, \f2\u9834?\f1\par
For peace has come\emdash war reigns no more! \f2\u9834?\f1\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I saw Jasper's beloved sword standing here, I could not believe my eyes.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When Sir Jasper died, I had believed all of his possessions vanished with him. But now his sword has reappeared, it is as if he has returned home.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know that the man I served chose to walk the wrong path. But still I think it a tragedy that there was no memorial for him in the kingdom he served for so long. His death was greeted only with silence.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please forgive me, but I would like to say a silent prayer for the man who once wielded this sword. It is my way of bidding him farewell...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know, thinking back, that shadow only ever appeared on this floor in the evening.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I always thought it might be watching the sun setting over Heliodor. Who could blame it\emdash it's a breathtaking sight.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Things have been ever so nice since that horrible shadowy thing stopped appearing. I can get on with my work without worrying about it appearing out of nowhere.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This tree is quite something, isn't it? It's been there since long before any of us were born. And that black shadow would always appear in front of it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ancient trees have a mysterious power we can't even hope to fathom. I have a funny feeling that the apparition we saw was an emanation of that power. Not that I could prove it, mind you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, that black shadowy thing seems to have vanished. I wonder where it went...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, whatever that shadowy thing was, it seems to have stopped appearing.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: To be honest, I wasn't really scared of it. There was just something about it that made me really sad. What could have brought it here, I wonder...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We haven't had a single sighting of that apparition of late. I suppose we'll never know what it was or what it was doing here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx3366\cellx10367 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, good riddance, quite frankly. But the funny thing is, I still think about it a lot\emdash it's like the gloominess it brought hasn't quite cleared up yet.\cell\row 
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\cf0\f0\par
}
␀